<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga kama vuwandikigwe na Yohana ni umwe mwa zija senga nne za Mulungu zili Mchitabu cha Lagano da Sambi zija zifambula ugima wa Yesu Kilisito. Chila chimwe mvitabu ivo chokemigwa,“Usenga wa Mulungu,” manake, “Lagano da sambi.” Zandikigwe na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana viibitile ifa ya Yesu. Usenga wa Mulungu kama vuwandikigwe na Yohana yolongeka yandikigwa na mtumigwa Yohana kama milao tisini vino kulawa viyavumbuke Kilisito. Hata kama chitabu hachilonga kua Yohana iyo yandike, mpangililo wa kwandika uwigala na uja ulimuzibalua za 1 Yohana na 2 Yohana na 3 Yohana. Wandikaji wamwenga wa umwaka womsimulila Yohana kakala yokala kae ya Efeso mchipindi icho ivo kwa ulonzi yooneka kua chitabu chino chikala chandikigwe uko Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana kalonga chinagaubaga kua chija chiagesile mchitabu chino ni kuwataza wanhu watogole Yesu Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu yeli na ugima. 20:31. Kwa kutogola dino, chopata ugima kuilinga na viyalonda Yesu. Chitabu chino chiwandikila wose Wayahudi na waja haweli Wayahudi. Usenga wa Yohana kwa chiasi fulani hauigalile ng'hani na zija senga zimwenga nhatu. Yohana kagangamiza ng'hani kwa mbuli ya uzonza iyasang'hane Yesu na handike ng'hani mbuli ya mifano yake. Mbuli zimwenga ng'hulu kama kubatizigwa kwa Yesu na kugezigwa kwa Yesu kuja kuchiwala izo ivija hazandikigwe muuno usenga unogile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Galiumo mchitabu chino</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana kasonga usenga wa Mulungu muisula 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala Yohana kandika miuzonza imwenga ija iyasang'hane Yesu muisula 1:19-12-50.</para>
  <para style="io">Amala hamwande Yohana kafambula mbuli nyingi muugima wa Yesu uja umgalile mbaka muifa yake na uzilibuko 13:1-20-31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana kakomeleza usenga muisula 21 yolongelela chipindi chimwe vija Yesu viyailaguse kwa wanhu haja viyazilibuke na baho kosimulila viyagesile mbuli za kwandika chitabu chino.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Haumwanduso kabula ya vinhu vose havinalumbigwa hakala na Usenga, na Usenga kakala hamwe na Mulungu, nawo Usenga kakala Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Nayo Usenga kakala hamwe na Mulungu kulawa haumwanduso.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Vinhu vose vilumbigwa kubitila kwa iyo usenga, na bila iyo habule chinhu chochose chilumbigwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mgati mwake kukala na ugima, na ugima uno ukala bung'hulo da wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Bung'hulo ijo dobung'hula mdiziza, na ziza hadidahile kudihuma ijo bung'hulo.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Hakala na munhu imwe yatumigwe na Mulungu zina jake Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yohana keza kuwalongela wanhu mbuli ya iyo bung'hulo, ivo wanhu wose wadahe kuhulika usenga na kutogola. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Iyo Yohana hakalile iyo bung'hulo, mbali keza yadahe kuwalongela wanhu mbuli iyo bung'hulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Iyo iyo bung'hulo da kweli, bung'hulo keza muuisi yawabung'hulile wanhu wose.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Usenga kakala Muuisi, na vinhu vose vilumbigwa kubitila iyo, mbali wanhu weli muisi hawammanyile. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Keza kwa wanhu wake, mbali wanhu wake hawambokele. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Mbali waja wambokele na kumtogola, kaweng'ha udaho wa kusang'hanigwa kua wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Wano hawapatile udaho wa kuwa wanage Mulungu kwa nzila ya kuleligwa kubitila tata na mami yao, hebu waleligwa wana kwa nzila iyolonda tata, Mulungu mwenyego iyo Tata. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Usenga utendigwa lukuli nayo kakala kumwetu, yamemile unovu wa Mulungu na kweli. Chiuna ukulu wake, ukulu kama Mwana waiyeka wa Tata.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana kawalongela wanhu mbuli zake, kakala yokwinula dizi yolonga, “Ino iyo ija niwalongele mbuli zake, ‘Kokwiza hachisogo yangu, mbali ni mkulu kubita niye, kwa vija kakala baho kabula ya niye.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwa unovu wake wose wenele cheye chose chibokela unovu wa Mulungu kaidi na kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwa vija ndagizi zigaligwa kwa nzila ya Musa, mbali unovu wa Mulungu na kweli ziza kubitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Habule munhu mbee yapatile kumwona Tata. Mwana yaiyeka yeli behi na Tata, ino iyo yatendile Tata yamanyike.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Zino izo mbuli ziyalongile Yohana, chipindi vilongozi wa Wayahudi kuja Yelusalem viwawatumile Walava nhambiko na Walawi ili wamuuze, “Gweye nani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana halemile kuwedika mbuli iyo, ila kawalongela, “Niye sio Kilisito mlohozi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Baho wamuuza, kwaivo, “Gweye nani? Gweye iyo Eliya?” Yohana kedika, “Hambe sio niye.” Wamuuza, “Ivo, Gweye iyo ija mlagusi wa Mulungu yalongigwe kokwiza?” Yohana kedika, “Habule,”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Walonga, “Kwaivo chilongele gweye kwa nani,” Gweye kolongaze kwa mbuli yako mwenyego? chilongele ili chipate cha kuwalongela waja wachitumile.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana kawedika, kama viyalongile mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya. “Niye ‘iyo ija mlagusi wa Mulungu Isaya yalongile, “Dizi da munhu dokema kuchiwala, igoloseni nzila iyobitila Mndewa!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Wanhu wao wakala watumigwe na Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />baho wamuuza Yohana, “Kama gweye sio Kilisito, hebu sio Eliya na hebu Mlagusi ija wa Mulungu, habali kobatiza?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana kalonga, “Niye nobatiza kwa mazi, mbali mgati yenu kema ija hamummanyile. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Iyo yokwiza hachisogo yangu, niye kumwake sifaya hata kufungula nzabi za makwabazi gake.” <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mbuli izo zitendeka uko Betania umwambu mwa lwanda wa Yoludani, uko Yohana hayakalile yobatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mwana bung'hukilalo wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Igolo yake Yohana kamwona Yesu yokwiza hamwande yake, kalonga, “Ino iyo Mwanang'hondolo wa Mulungu yosola malozo ga wanhu wa muuisi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ino iyo niwalongele mbuli yake nilonga, ‘hachisogo yangu kokwiza munhu hachisogo yangu, mbali iyo ni mkulu kubita niye kwa vija kakala baha kabula ya niye.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Niye mwenyego ng'hala simmanyile, mbali niza kubatiza wanhu kwa mazi kwa mbuli iyo ili Waizilaeli wammanye.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Amala Yohana kalonga vija viyatammanyile Yesu, “Niwona muhe wa Mulungu wohulumuka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kama hua na kukala uchanha yake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Hata niye simmanyile, mbali iyo yanhumile kubatiza wanhu kwa mazi, iyo yanongele, ‘Uhamwona munhu ija yohulumukiligwa na Muhe wa Mulungu na kukala uchanha yake, iyo iyo yobatiza kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Niye mwenyego niyona mbuli ino na notogola kulonga kua ino iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waluko wa mwanduso wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Igolo yake Yohana kakala kaidi hanhu haja hamwe na waluko wake waidi, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />viyamwonile Yesu kobita, kalonga, “Loleni, ino iyo Mwana ng'hondolo wa Mulungu!” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Waja waluko waidi viwamuhulike Yohana viyolonga gago, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu viyageluke kukisogo, kawaona womuwinza, kawauza, “Mozambwila choni?” Wamlongela, “Labi” Manake Mfundaji, “Gweye mfundaji kokala kulihi?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu kedika, “Izoni mlole,” Hao waluko wamuwinza, waita waona hanhu haja hayokala, wasinda nayo zua jose, viyawagoneke iyo ikala saa kumi chigulogulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andelea, yakalile tata imwe na Simoni Petulo, kakala imwe mwa waja waidi wamhulike Yohana na kumuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andelea iyo yalongole kumwona Simoni, wa tata imwe, wamlongela, “Chimuona Masiya Manake, “Yasaguligwe na Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Amala kamgala Simoni kwa Yesu. Nayo Yesu viyamlolile Simoni kalonga, “Gweye iyo Simoni mwanage Yohana. Sambi kokemigwa Kefa.” Kwa kigiliki manake Petulo, yani, “Dibwe kulu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema Filipo na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Igolo yake Yesu kalonda kuita Galilaya. Na uko kamvika Filipo na kamlongela, “Niwinze.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Nayo Filipo kakala mwenekae wa Betisaida, kae yakina Andelea na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo kamvika Natanaeli, kamlongela, “Chimvika ija yandikiligwe mbuli zake na Musa mvitabu va ndagizi, na ija walagusi wa Mulungu wandika mbuli zake, yani Yesu mwana wa Yusufu, kulawa kae ya Nazaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli kamuuza Filipo, ivo, “Yodahika mbuli inogile kulawa Nazaleti?” Filipo kamlongela, “Izo ulole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Haja Yesu viyamonile Natanaeli kokwiza kumwake, kamlongela, “Loleni ino iyo Muizilaeli kweli, kabule gehile mmoyo.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli kamuuza, “Kunimanyaze?” Yesu kamwidika, “Nikuona kulawa vuukalile hasi hamkuyu, yang'hali Filipo hanakukema.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaeli kamlongela, “Mfundaji, gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu! Gweye iyo Mfaume wa Izilaeli!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu kedika, kamlongela, “Ivo kunhogola kwa vija nikulongela nikuona vuukalile hasi hamkuyu? Kogaona makulu ng'hani kubita gano.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongeleni kweli, mouona Ulanga wogubuka na watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wokwela na kuhulumuka kuchanha kwambuli ya Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Zengele uko Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Mdizua da kadatu hakala na zengele uko kae ya Kana, isi ya Galilaya. Mami yake Yesu kakala uko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />nayo Yesu kakala yagonekigwe mdizengele hamwe na waluko wake. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai viimalile, mami yake Yesu kawalongela, “Divai imala.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu kamwidika mami yake, “Mami nokupula sekeunongele cha kutenda saa ya kulagusa ukulu wangu ing'hali.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mami yake Yesu kawalongela watumigwa, “Sang'haneni jojose dondayawalongele.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Baho hakala na nongo sita za mabwe, zikala zikigwa uko kama viikalile mazoela ga Wayahudi ga kuisunha, chila nongo imwe yodaha kwingila umo mazi ga madebe maidi hebu madatu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu kawalongela, “Zimemezeni mazi nongo izo.” Nawo wazimemeza mazi mbaka ndu, <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />labaho kawalongela, “Baho deheni mumgalile mwenezengele.” Bahaja wasola, wamgalila. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Nayo mwenezengele viyalanzile mazi gaja, katambula kua gageluka divai. Nayo haimanyile divai ija kuilawile, mbali waja watumigwa wake wagalile mazi gaja wavimanya, baho kamkema hamgwazo ija mfunga zengele, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />kamlongela, “Wanhu wose tanhu wosonga kulava divai inogile, amala wogala ija divai izabuke. Mbali gweye kwika divai ija inogile ng'hani mbaka vino sambi!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Uwo ukala ulaguso wa mosi uyatendile Yesu uko kae ya Kana isi ya Galilaya, baho Yesu kaulagusa ukulu wake na Waluko wake wamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Viyakomeleze gago, Yesu kahulumuka hamwe na mami yake na ndugu zake na waluko wake waita Kapelenaumu na kukala uko mazua madodo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koita Kuing'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matayo 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Behi na zua da lusona lwa Pasaka, ivo Yesu kakwela kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Haja muing'anda ya Mulungu kawavika wanhu wogula ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na njiwa, na wanhu wamwenga wagula sente wakala mzimeza zao. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu katenda mbalati ya nzabi, na kawawinga wose kunze kulawa muing'anda ya Mulungu, hamwe na ng'hondolo na ng'ombe zao, kazipwililisa sente za wagula sente na kuzihindula meza zao, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />kawakomokela waja wakalile wogula njiwa, “Visegezeni vinhu vino hano! Seke muitende ng'anda ya tataangu kama gulilo!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Waja waluko wake wakumbuka mayandiko galongile, “Wende wangu kwa ng'anda yako wong'homa.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Wayahudi wamwenga wamwidika wamuuza, “Kodaha kuchilavila ulaguso gani ulaguse kua kunao udahi wa kusang'hana gano?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ibomoleni ng'anda ino ya Mulungu, na niye noizenga kaidi mmazua madatu.” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Waja wayahudi walonga, “Ng'anda ino ya Mulungu izengigwa kwa milao alubaini na sita. Ivo, gweye koizenga kwa mazua madatu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Mbali Yesu halongelele ng'anda ya Mulungu mbali kalongelela mbuli ya lukuli lwake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Viyazilibuligwe, waja waluko wake wakumbuka kua Yesu kagalonga gaja, na watogola mayandiko na gaja Yesu gayalongile.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kana udaho wa kumanya mioyo ya wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Chipindi Yesu viyakalile Yelusalemu muulusona wa Pasaka, wanhu wengi wamtogole waona vilaguso viyatendile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Mbali Yesu hakalile na nhogolwa nao kwa vija kakala kawamanya wose viweli mmioyo yao. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ivija halondile muhnu yoyose yamlongele mbuli za wanhu, kwa vija kagamanya gose gali muumoyo wao.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Hakala na kilongozi imwe Myahudi, kakala imwe mwa waja Mafalisayo zina jake Nikodemu, mkulu wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Mdizua dimwe Nikodemu kaita kwa Yesu ichilo kamlongela, “Labi, chivimanya kua gweye iyo mfundaji yatumigwe na Mulungu, manake habule munhu yonda yasang'hane vilaguso vino yuuvisang'hana, kama Mulungu heli nayo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu kedika kamlongela, “Nokulongela kweli, munhu hadaha kuwona Ufaume wa Mulungu mbaka yavumbuke mala ya kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu kamuuza, “Yodahikaze munhu mvele kuvumbuka mala ya kaidi? Kodahaze kwingila muiinda ya mami yake na kuvumbuka kaidi!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela kweli, munhu kama havumbuke kubitila mazi na muhe wa Mulungu hadaha mbe kwingila Muufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Munhu kovumbuka kilukuli kubitila tata na mami yake, na munhu kovumbuka kimuhe kubitila muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ivo sekeukanganye vinikulongela kolondeka uvumbuke mala ya kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mbeho yobuma hohose haulonda, Mbuhmo wake kouhulika vuubuma, mbali hudaha kuumanya kuulawa hebu kuuita. Ivo ivo ili kwa munhu yavumbuke kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo kamuuza, “Mbuli zino zokuwaze?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu kamlongela, Ivo! Gweye iyo mfundaji wa Waizilaeli mbali ung'hali hunazitambula mbuli zino? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nokulongela kweli, cheye chogalonga gaja gachigamanyile na chowalongela gaja gachigaonile, mbali mweye hamutogola usenga wetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Yahawa niwalongela mbuli za muuisi, mweye hamnitogole, modahaze kunitogola nihawalongela mbuli za kuulanga kwa Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Labaho habule munhu yoyose yaitile kuulanga kwa Mulungu, mbali Mwana wa Munhu, yahulumuke kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Kama vija Musa viyemtundike ija nyoka wa shaba mumbiki kuja kuluwala, ivo mwana wa Munhu kolondeka kutundikwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ili chila munhu yonda yamtogole yakale na ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Manake Mulungu kana wende ng'hani na wanhu wa muuisi zose, mbaka kamlava mwanage waiyeka, ili chila munhu yomtogola sekeyage, mbali yapate ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Manake, Mulungu hamtumile Mwanage muziisi zose ili yawalamule wanhu weli muziisi, mbali kubitila Mwanage yawakombole. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yomtogola Mwana halamuligwa, ija hamtogole mwana tiyali kamala kulamuligwa, kwa vija hamtogole Mwana wa iyeka wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Na ulamuzi uwo uno, najo bung'hulo diza muziisi mbali wanhu walonda ziza kubita bung'hulo, kwa vija sang'hano zao za ubananzi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Manake chila munhu yosang'hana gehile kodihila bung'hulo, hebu heza mdibung'hulo, manake halonda sang'hano zake za ubananzi sekeumanyike. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Mbali iyo yosang'hana za kweli, kokwiza mdibung'hulo ili sang'hano zake zioneke zitendigwa kwa kumtegeleza Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizi kulongelela mbuli za Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Vigamalile gago, Yesu na waluko wake waita mbaka isi ya Yudea, nayo kakala uko kwa chipindi chidodo kuno kobatiza wanhu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana nayo kakala kobatiza uko Ainoni behi na Salimu kwa vija uko kukala na mazi gamemile ng'hani. Wanhu wengi wakala woita uko nayo kawabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ino itendeka kabula Yohana hanageligwa mchifungo. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Wakala wolema kuitogolela kati ya waluko wamwenga wa Yohana na Myahudi imwe kwa mbuli ya kutogoligwa kwa kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Baho waluko waita kwa Yohana wamlongela, “Mfundaji ija munhu yakalile nayo umwambu wa lwanda wa Yoludani, ija yuulongile mbuli zake, sambi nayo kobatiza na wanhu wose womuwinza!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana kawedika kalonga, “Habule munhu yoyose yonda yawe na chinhu mbaka yeng'higwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mweye wenyego motogola kua nilonga, ‘Niye sio Kilisito msaguligwa na Mulungu ila nhumigwa ili nimlongolele.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mfunga zengele iyo yomsola mhambe. Mbali mbwiga wa mfunga zengele, ija yokwima behi nayo na kutegeleza, kodeng'helela ng'hani yahategeleza dizi da mfunga zengele viyolonga. Kwa mbuli ino ndeng'helelo yangu yenela. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu kolondeka yatogoligwe ng'hani, na niye nhogolwa yangu ihungule.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za ija yokwiza kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Iyo yokwiza kulawa kuulanga, iyo mkulu kubita wose. Yolawa muziisi iyo wamuziisi, muziisi kokua uchanha ya gose, yeye yeli wa muziisi iyo wa muziisi, nayo kozilonga mbuli za muziisi. Mbali iyo yokwiza kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, iyo mkulu kubita wose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Iyo kolonga gaja gayaonile na kugahulika, mbali habule munhu yotogola usenga wake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ivo, munhu yoyose yotogola usenga wake, iyo yogangamiza kua, Mulungu ni kweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ija yatumigwe na Mulungu kolonga usenga wa Mulungu, kwa vija Mulungu komwing'ha Muhe wake bila chipimo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tata kana wende na Mwanage, ivija kamwing'ha vinhu vose mmakono gake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yomtogola Mwana kana ugima ulibule uhelelo, Ija hamtogola Mwana hopata ugima ulibule uhelelo, mbali kopatigw na ludoko lwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela na Mwanachike Msamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo wahulika kua Yesu kakala kowasang'hana na kowabatiza waluko wengi ng'hani kubita Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Mbali Yesu mwenyego hakalile yobatiza ila waluko wake. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Baho Yesu viyahulike gago kalawa Yudea kabwela isi ya Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />na muumwanza uwo kalondeka yabitile Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Kavika muikae imwe ya Samalia yokemigwa Sikali, habehi na uja mgunda Yakobo yamwing'hile Mwanage Yusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hanhu haja hakala na chisima cha Yakobo, Nayo Yesu kakala yalegele kwa mbuli ya mwanza uwo, kakala mumgwazo ya chisima. Ikala yovika saa sita imisi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwanachike imwe Msamalia keza kudeha mazi, Yesu kamlongela, “Ning'he mazi ning'we.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Chipindi icho waluko wake wakala waitile ku ikae kugula ndiya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mbali ija mwanachike kamlongela, “Gweye Myahudi na niye Msamalia, yodahikaze unipule mazi ga kung'wa?” Wayahudi hawailumbayokwing'ha hamwe mazi mchikombe hebu bakuli.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu kedika kawalongela, “Kama wahamanyile gweko daMulungu, nayo iyo nani yokulongele, ‘Ning'he mazi ning'we,’ gweye wahampulile iyo, nayo yahakwing'hile mazi yokusang'hana ukale na ugima ulibule uhelelo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ija mwana chike kedika, “Mndewa, gweye kwabule da kudehela mazi mchisima chino chitali. Gago mazi ga ugima ulibule uhelelo kogapataze?” <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Hebu gweye koitenda kwa mkulu kubita tata yetu Yakobo? Yaching'hile chisima chino, nayo mwenyego na wanage na wanyama wake wofugigwa wang'wa mazi ga chisima chino.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu kamwidika, “Yoyose yong'wa mazi gano koona ng'hilu kaidi, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />“Mbali yoyose yong'wa mazi ganimwing'ha niye, haona ng'hilu mbe. Mazi yonda nimwing'he mgati yake kolava nzasa ya mazi gaugima na kumwing'ha ugima ulibule uhelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ija mwanachike kamlongela, “Mndewa, chonde chonde ning'he gago mazi ili sekemhate ng'hilu kaidi na ivija sekenize kaidi hano kudeha mazi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu kamlongela, “Genda kamkeme mulume wako, wize nayo hano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ija mwanachike kalonga, “Nabule mulume.” Yesu kamlongela, “Kulonga goya vuulongile kwabule mulume. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Manake kukala na walume watano na iyo mulume ulinayo sambi sio mulume wako baho kulonga kweli!”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ija mwanachike kamlongela, “Mndewa, noona gweye iyo mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />“Wasao wetu kulawa Samalia wamfugamila muulugongo uno, mbali mweye Wayahudi mwolonga kwa kumfugamila Mulungu ni kuja Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu kamlongela, “Gweye mwanachike, nhogolele, wokwiza msimo honda mdahe kumfugamila Tata mulugongo uno, hebu uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mweye Wasamalia mofugamila chinhu hamchimanyile. Mbali cheye Wayahudi chomfugamila Mulungu chimanyile kwa vija ulohozi wolawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Mbali chipindi chokwiza, kaidi chimala kuvika, wanhu womfugamila Tata kweli kwa kulongozigwa na muhe na kweli. Wanhu wofugama kama vino, iyo yowazambwila Tata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mulungu ni Muhe na wose womfugamila wolondeka kumfugamila Muumuhe wa Mulungu na kweli.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ija mwanachike kamlongela, “Novimanya kua Mesia yokemigwa Kilisito kokwiza. Iyo yaheza, kochilongela mbuli zose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu kamlongela, “Iyo yoolonga nayo, iyo niye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Baho waja waluko wake wabwela na wakanganya ng'hani kumwona kolonga na ija mwanachike. Mbali habule yamuuzile, “Kolonda choni kumwake?” Hebu “Habali kolonga na mwanachike?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Amala mwanachike ija kaileka nongo yake, kabwela kuikae na kuwalongela wanhu,<verse eid="JHN 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Izoni mlole munhu yanongele chila chinhu chinisang'hane.” Ivo, yodahika kua ino iyo Kilisito?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Baho wanhu walawa muikae wamuitila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Chipindi ichija waluko wake wakala wompula Yesu wamlongela, “Mfundaji, diya walau chidogo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Niye nna ndiya ija mweye hamuimanyile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Baho waluko wake wailola wasonga kuiuza wenyego, “Ivo hana munhu yoyose yamgalile ndiya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ndiya yangu iyo ino ni kusang'hana mbuli zinogile za yanhumile kukomeleza sang'hano jake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mweye molonga, ‘Isigala miezi mine tu, na chipindi cha mlao chovika?’ Mbali niye nowalongeleni inuleni meso genu mlole ija migunda viili tiyali kugoboligwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mgobolaji kopata chitumetume chake, na yokunzanya ndiya igoboligwe kwa mbuli ya ugima ulibule uhelelo, ivo mhandaji na mgobolaji wodeng'helela hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwa mbuli iyo ulonzi uno ni woolonga, ‘Imwenga kohanda na imwenga kogobola ni kweli. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Niye nimtumeni mkagobole ndiya ija hamuihandiye, wamwenga wasang'hana sang'hano, mbali mweye moja ndiya waigaiye wayenu.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamalia wengi wa chijiji chija wamtogola kwa mbuli ya ulonzi uyalongile ija mwanachike, “Kanilongela mbuli zose zinisang'hane.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Wasamalia wamuitila Yesu, wampula yakale nao, nayo kakala nawo baho mazua maidi.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Wanhu wengi ng'hani wamtogola kwa mbuli ya usenga wake, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />na wamlongela ija mwanachike, “Cheye hachitogola tu kwa mbuli ya usenga wako, cheye wenyego chihulika na chivimanya kua ino iyo kweli mlohozi wa isi zose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mbwanga wa Chilongozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Vigabitile mazua maidi, Yesu kalawa baho kaita uko Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Manake Yesu mwenyego kalonga kua, “Mlagusi wa Mulungu hatogoligwa muiisi yake. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Baho viyavikile uko Galilaya, Wagalilaya wambokela, manake nao wakala mulusona wa Pasaka, kwa vija wakala waziona mbuli zose ziyasang'hane Yesu uko Yelusalemu mchipindi cha lusona wa Pasaka.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Amala Yesu kabwela kaidi muikae ya Kana isi ya Galilaya hanhu haja hayatendile mazi yageluke kua divai. Hakala na chilongozi imwe wa Silikali yeli na mwana mtamu uko Kapelenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Baho chilongozi iyo viyehulike Yesu kakala kalawa Yudea na kuvika Galilaya, kamuitila na kumpula yaite kumhonya mwanage yakalile mtamu lagalaga. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu kamlongela, “Gweye kama huwonile vilaguso na uzonza honda mtogole mbe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Chilongozi ija kamlongela, “Mhenga, nokupula chite kabula mwanangu hanadanganika.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu kamlongela, “Genda tu mwanago kahona!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Mkulu ija katogola ulozi wa Yesu, kasegela. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Viyakalile yobwela yang'hali mnzila waiting'hanila wamlongela kua mwanago kahona!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nayo kawauza saa nyingahi mwana iyo viyahonile, nao wamlongela ikala jana chipindi cha saa saba utamu wa homa uhona. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Ivo Tati yake kavimanya kua saa iija yalongiligwe na Yesu kua, “Mwanago kohona.” Nayo katogola hamwe nawayage wose.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Chino chilaguso cha kaidi chiyasang'hane Yesu viyakalile yolawa Yudea kuita Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya mbetembete mdizua da kuhumula da Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Amala baho, hakala na lusona wa dini ya Kiyahudi, nayo Yesu kaita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Uko Yelusalemu behi na lwivi ukemigwa lwivi lwa ng'hondolo, hakala na lamba da mazi dikemigwa kwa Chiebulania Betizata, najo dikala na sanha tano vili na vizanda. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Umo muluhelengo wakala watamu wengi watambalale,wanhu hao wakala vipofu na mbetembete na waholole ng'huli wakala wobeta mazi gatibuligwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Manake hana chipindi na chipindi mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kakala kohulumuka na kwingila mdilamba na kugatibula mazi. Baho yalongole kwingila mgamazi gatibuligwe kohona utamu wake wose yelinao. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Baho hakala na munhu imwe yakalile mtamu kwa milao selasini na minane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu viyamonile iyo munhu kawasa, kuno yovimanya mtamu iyo kakala baho kwa mazua mengi, kamuuza, “Vilihi, konda kuhona?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Ija mtamu kalonga, “Muhenga niye nabule munhu wa kunigela mgamazi gatibuligwe. Kwa vija chila nihageza kwingila, munhu imwenga konilongolela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu kamlongela, “Ima, sola chilago chako ugende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bahaja mtamu ija kahona, kasola chilago chake kagenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Nayo ikala zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi , <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />kwa mbuli iyo, Wayahudi wamlongela ija munhu yahonyigwe, “Lelo ijo zua da kuhumula, ndagizi yolema sekeupape chilago chako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Mbali nayo kawalongela, “Ija munhu yanihonyile, iyo yanongele, ‘Sola chilago ugende.’”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nao wamuuza, “Iyo munhu yakulongele, ‘Sola chilago chako ugende,’ yelihi?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Mbali munhu ija yahonyigwe, hammanyile munhu yamuhonyile, manake Yesu kakala yasegele hanhu haja, kwa vija kakala kaihanganya na wanhu wengi.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hamwande chidogo, Yesu kaiting'hana na munhu ija yahonyigwe Muing'anda ya Mulungu, kamlongela, “Sambi kuhona, seke usang'hane malozo kaidi, kwa vija kodaha kupata dihile ng'hani kubita ijo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Munhu ija kaita na kuwalongela waja vilongozi wa Wayahudi kua Yesu iyo yamhonyile. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwa vija Yesu kasang'hana mbuli iyo mdizua da kuhumula, Ivo baho Wayahudi wasonga kumgaza. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, Tati yangu kosang'hana sang'hano mbaka sambi, na niye nosang'hana ivija.<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Mbuli zino ziwehila ng'hani vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Baho watonga chila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, si kwa vija, kakala yabanange ijo zua da kuhumula, mbali ivija kamkema Mulungu kua Tati yake, kwambuli iyo koilinga na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni kweli, Mwana hadaha kusang'hana mbuli yoyose yaiyeka, mbaka yamwone Tati yake choosang'hana, kwa vija jojose Tata yodisang'hana, Mwana nayo kosang'hana ivo.” <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Tata kamtogola Mwana, na kumlagusila chila chinhu choyosang'hana yeye mwenyego, kaidi komlagusila mbuli ng'hulu kubita zino, na mweye mokanganya. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Manake kama vija Tata viwowazilibule wafile na kuweng'ha ugima, ivija nayo Mwana koweng'ha ugima waja yowalonda. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Tata hamlamula munhu yoyose, mbali mbuli yose ya kulamula kamwing'ha Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />ili wanhu wose wamtegeleze Mwana kama viwomtegeleza Tata. Munhu yoyose hamtegeleze Mwana hamtegeleza Tata yamtumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Nowalongela kweli, munhu yoyose yohulika usenga wangu, na kumtogola ija yanhumile, kana ugima ulibule uhelelo. Holamuligwa mbe mbali kabita kulawa muifa kengila muugima.” <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nowalongela kweli, chipindi chokwiza kaidi chivika haja wafile wodihulika dizi da Mwana wa Mulungu, nawo wohulika wokua wagima. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kama vija Tata viyeli chanduso cha ugima, ivija kamwing'ha Mwanage kua chanduso cha ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kaidi kamwing'ha udahi wa kulamula manake iyo Munhu Mulungu yamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />“Neke mkanganye mbuli ino manake chipindi chokwiza wose weli mmapanga wodihulika dizi jake. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Nawo wozilibuka na waja wasang'hane ganogile wozilibuka na kuwa na ugima ulibule uhelelo na waja wasang'hane ubananzi, wozilibuka na kulamuligwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waja wazililongela mbuli za Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Niye sidaha kusang'hana chinhu chochose kwa udahi wangu mwenyego. Niye nolamula kama vinihulika kulawa kwa Tata, na ulamuzi wangu hauonela munhu. Silonda kusang'hana vinilonda mwenyego, mbali viyolonda ija yanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Mbali nihailongelela niye mwenyego gaja ganisang'hana, na gaja ganilonga hagatogoligwa kuwa kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Mbali kabaho imwenga yozilongelela mbuli zangu na nivimanya kua gose gayalonga kwa mbuli yangu ga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mweye mtuma wasenga kwa Yohana, nayo kailongelela ija kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Niye situmanila wanhu wanilongelele, nolonga mbuli zino ili wanhu wapate kuloholigwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana kakala kama lumuli lukwaka na kubung'hula, na mweye mukala modeng'helela bung'hulo jake kwa chipindi chidodo. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Mbali niye nina dakuilongelela kulu ng'hani kubita da Yohana. Zija sang'hano zinisang'hana, sang'hano ziyaning'hile Tata nizisang'hane, izo zolongelela kua Tata iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Nayo Tata yanhumile hunilongelela. Mweye hamnadihulika mbe. Hamdihulike mbe dizi jake hebu kulola lumbo jake, hebu kuona chihanga chake, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />na mweye hamgatogola gaja goyolonga, kwa vija hamumtogole ija yamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mweye mololesa Mayandiko ga Mulungu kwa kutonga kuwa gowalongoza muugima ulibule uhelelo, mbali Mayandiko gago gonilongelela niye. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Hata ivo mweye hamlonda kwiza kumwangu kupata ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Niye silonda kutogoligwa na wanhu mbe. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Mbali nowamanya kua mweye mwabule wende wa Mulungu mmiyoyo yenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Niye niza kwa udaho wa Tataangu, mweye hamnibokele, mbali yaheza munhu imwenga kwa udahi wake mwenyego mombokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Modahaze kutogola haja mweye wenyego molonda kubokela nhogolwa kulawa kumwenu mweye wenyego, wala hamlonda nhogolwa kulawa kumwake iyo yeli Mulungu yaiyeka? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Sekemtonge kua niye nowalongeleza kwa Tata. Musa imumtumainila iyo yonda yawalongeleze. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Maza mwahamtogole Musa mwahanitogole na niye ivija, manake Musa kazandika mbuli yangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Mbali hamgatogole gaja gayandike, basi modahaze kuzitogola usenga wangu.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndiya wanhu elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Viyakomeleze gago, Yesu kaloka mbaka umwambu wa lamba da Galilaya hebu lamba da Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Na bumbila kulu da wanhu dimuwinza, kwa vija wanhu wao waona vilaguso viyasang'hane va kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu kakwela kulugongo na kakala hamwe na waluko wake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Chipindi icho lusona lwa Wayahudi ukemigwa Pasaka ukala mmabehi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Baho Yesu viyaonile bumbila kulu da wanhu domuwinza, kamlongela Filipo, “Chigule halihi migate ili wanhu wano waje?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu kamuuza mbuli iyo Filipo kwa kumgeza, kwa vija kakala kakimanya mwenyego chakusang'hana. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo kamwidika, “Hata chahawa na sente kwechekweche, havidahika kugula ndiya ya kuwenela wanhu wano wose na chila munhu yabokele chihande chidogo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mwaluko imwe mwa waja waluko wake, yokemigwa Andelea, wa tata imwe na Simoni Petulo, kamlongela Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hano hana mbwanga yali na migate mitano na somba waidi, mbali ino haidaha kuwenela wose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu kalonga, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale hasi.” Haja hakala na mayani mengi, baho wanhu waja walume wadile wobita elufu tano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Baho Yesu kaisola ija migate, kamwing'ha Mulungu hewela, na kuwagolela wanhu wose wakalile haja, na katenda ivo kwa waja somba na chila munhu kabokela chija chiyalondile. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Wanhu viwegute Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Vidondoleni vija vihande va migate mwike hamwe sekevage.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ivo wavidondola vija vihande vose visigale va migate na somba na kumemeza vigelo kumi na vidi. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Amala waja wanhu viwaonile chija chilaguso chiyasang'hane Yesu, wasonga kulonga, “Enaa ino iyo ija Mlagusi wa Mulungu yokwiza muuisi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu viyavimanyile kuwa walonda kwiza kumgoga na kumtenda yawe mfaume wawo, kainega nawo kaita yaiyeka kuja kulugongo.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogenda uchanha ya mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Hadiswele zua, waja waluko wake waita kuja kudilamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />wengila muingalawa wasonga kuloka kuita kae ya Kapelenaumu. Ziza dikala dokwingila na Yesu kakala hanawavikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ng'humbi ng'hulu ya mazi ilawila mdilamba kwa vija beho kulu disonga kubumha. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Waja waluko wake viwakalile waita behi na kilomita tano hebu sita, wamuwona Yesu kogenda uchanha ya gaja mazi behi na kuivikila ija ngalawa,waja waluko wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Sekemdumbe iyo niye.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Waitogolela yengile muingalawa, bahaja waona ngalawa ivika umwambu kuja kuwakalile woita.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu womzambwila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Igolo yake, dija bumbila da wanhu dikalile disigale umwambu mwa lamba wavimanya kua haja hakala na ngalawa imwe tu, na Yesu haitile hamwe na waluko wake, mbali waluko wake wakala waita waiyeka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ngalawa zimwenga kulawa Tibelia zivika hanhu haja hawadile ija migate haja Yesu viyakomeleze kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Baho waja wanhu viwamanyile kua Yesu hawile haja hebu waluko wake. Ivo wengila muingalawa waita mbaka Kapelenaumu kumzambwila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mgate ugala ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Viwamvikile Yesu umwambu wa lamba wamuuza, “Mfundaji, kuvika lini hano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu kawalongela, nowalongeleni kweli, mweye monizambwila sio kwa vija mkala muonile chilaguso, mbali kwa vija mja ija migate na mwiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Seke muhunganikile ndiya ija iyola, mbali hunganikileni ndiya ija haimala kwa mbuli ya ugima ulibule uhelelo. Mwana wa Munhu ija Tata yomulongelela komwing'heni ndiya iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Baho, wamuuza, “Cholondeka chitendeze ili chidahe kusang'hana sang'hano za Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ino iyo sang'hano iyolonda Mulungu muisang'hane, kumtogola ija yamtumile.” <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ivo wamuuza, chilaguso chilihi chonda uchisang'hane ili chikutogole? Ivija kosang'hana chinhu gani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />“Kama viyandikigwe tata zenu waja ndiya yokemigwa mana mchiwala kama Mayandiko vigalonga, ‘Kaweng'ha ndiya kulawa kuchanha kuulanga kwa Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Amala Yesu kawalogela, “Nowalongeleni kweli, si Musa yamwing'heni ndiya kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, mbali Tataangu iyo yomwing'heni ndiya kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Manake ndiya ya Mulungu ni ija ahulumuke kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, na kuweng'ha ugima wanhu muuisi.<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Baho wamlongela, “Mndewa, ching'he ndiya ino mmazua gose.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu kawalongela, “Niye iyo ndiya ya ugima. Munhu yokwiza kumwangu, hoona nzala mbe, ivija yonitogola hona ng'hilu mbe. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Mbali nowalongela hata kama mmbona mbali hamnitogole. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wanhu wose yoning'ha Tata wokua wajalusona wangu, na niye simwasa kunze mbe yoyose yokwiza kumwangu, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kwa vija niye nihulumuka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu si kwa mbuli ya kusang'hana gaja ganilonda, mbali niza kukomeleza gaja gayalonda ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na gaja gayalonda yanhumile iyo gano, kua sekenimwagize yoyose mwa waja yaning'hile, mbali niwazilibule wose mdizua da uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Manake chino icho choyolonda Tataangu, chila yomoona Mwana na kumtogola yawe na ugima ulibule uhelelo, na niye nomzilibula mdizua da uhelelo.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Baho wayahudi wasonga kumnung'unikila, kwa vija kalonga, “Niye ni ndiya ihulumuke kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Wakala wolonga, “Ivo ino sio mwanage Yusufu? Chimmanya mami yake na tati yake. Ivo kodahaze kulonga kahulumuka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu kawalongela, “Lekeni kuinung'unikila wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Habule munhu yonda yeze kumwangu, kama Tata yanhumile hamkwegile kumwangu, na niye nomzilibula muukomelezo wa zua. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mvitabu va walagusi wa Mulungu vandika, ‘Wanhu wose wokuwa wafundigwa na Tata.’ Chila munhu yamuhulike Tata na kuvimanya, kokwiza kumwangu.’ <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Ino hailagusa kuwa kuna munhu kamuona Tata, mbali ija yalawile kwa Mulungu, iyo iyo yamonile Tata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nowalongela kweli, iyo yanitogole kana ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Niye iyo ndiya ya ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Wavele wenu waija ndiya ya mana kuchiwala na wadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Mbali ino iyo ndiya uhulumuke kulawa kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, ili yoyose yonda yaje hadanganika. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Niye iyo ndiya ya ugima ihulumuke kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Munhu yoyose yoja ndiya ino kokala na ugima ulibule uhelelo. Na ndiya inimwing'ha ni lukuli lwangu, niulava kwa mbuli ya ugima wa wanhu muuisi.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Baho Wayahudi wasonga kuleka kuitogolela, “Ino kodahaze kuching'ha lukuli lwake chiuje?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni kweli, kama hamuuja uja lukuli lwa Mwana wa Munhu na kuing'wa damu yake, habule ugima mgati yenu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Chila munhu yonda yaje lukuli na kuing'wa damu yangu kanao ugima ulibule uhelelo, na niye nomzilibula mdizua da uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Manake lukuli lwangu iyo ndiya ya kweli na damu yangu icho chinhu cha kweli cha kung'wa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Munhu youja lukuli lwangu na kung'wa damu yangu, kokala mgati yangu na niye mgati yake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kama vija Tata yali mgima viyanhumile, na niye nina ugima kwanzila yake, ivija yonija niye kopata ugima kubitila niye. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ivo ino ndiya ihulumuka kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, sio kama ndiya ya mana waidile wasao zenu amala wadanganika. Yoija ndiya ino kokala na ugima ulibule uhelelo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu kalonga gago viyakalile yofunda Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi kuja Kapelenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga ugala ugima ulibule uhelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Baho wanhu wengi mwawaluko wake viwahulike mbuli ino walonga, “Mafundo gano madala, “Yalihi yodaha kuyatogola?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu viyamanyile kua waluko wake wonung'unika kwa mbuli ya mafundo gake, kawauza, “Ivo habali mbuli ino imulumizeni mmoyo mbaka mleke kutogola? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yokuwaze basi kama mwahamona Mwana wa Munhu yahainuligwa kuita kuja hayakalile haumwanduso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muhe wa Mulungu iyo yogala ugima, lukuli haudaha chinhu. Mbuli ziniwalongele ni muhe na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Hata ivo baho mmwenu wamwenga wenu hawatogola.” Yesu kalonga ivo kwa vija kavimanya kulawa haumwanduso kua welihi hawatogola na yelihi yolonda kumhinduka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Amala kalonga, kwa mbuli iyo niwalongela kua habule munhu yonda yadahe kwiza kumwangu mbaka yadahizigwe na Tati yangu.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kwa ulonzi uwo wajalusona wengi wahinduka chisogo, waleka kuilumba nayo kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Baho Yesu kawauza waja waluko wake kumi na waidi, na mweye ivija molonda kusegela? <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petulo kedika, Mndewa! Chiite kwa yelihi? Gweye iyo uli na usenga wa ugima ulibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Na cheye chitogola na kuvimanya kua gweye iyo Mnang'hana ulawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu kawalongela, “Ivo siwasagule mweye kumi na waidi? hata ivo imwe mmwenu ni Mwenembago! <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu kalonga gago kwa mbuli ya Yuda, mwanage Simoni Esikaliyote, manake iyo yonda yamuhinduke Yesu, hata ivo kakala imwe mwawaja kumi na waidi.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu hatogoligwe na wadodo zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Viyakomeleze gago, Yesu kakala yogenda yosang'hana sang'hano hanu hano na haja uko Galilaya, manake halondile kuita muisi ya Yudea, kwa vija vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakala wolonda kumkoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Na lusona wa Wayahudi wa Viheha yani ng'humbukizi ya mahame uko kuluwala ikala yammabehi, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ivo ndugu zake Yesu wamlongela, “Segela hano uite Isi ya Yudea ili waluko wako wazione sang'hano yuuzisang'hana. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Munhu hasang'hana mbuli mchifiso kama kolonda yamanyike na wanhu. Kwa vija kosang'hana mbuli izo, ivo ilaguse kwa wanhu muiisi. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Manake hata ndugu zake hawamtogole.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu kawalongela, “Chipindi changu chifaya ching'hali hachinavika, mbali kumwenu mweye chila chipindi chofaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Wanhu wa muuisi hawadaha kuwehila mweye, mbali konihila niye kwa vija nolonga kweli kua sang'hano zao ziha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mweye muite muulusona uwo. Mbali niye siita kuulusona uwo kwa vija chipindi changu chifaya hachinavika. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kasigala Galilaya ukuja.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu muulusona wa Viheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ndugu zake viwaitile kulusona wa viheha, Yesu nayo kaita, mbali haitile chila munhu yomuona ila kaita kwa kuibanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wakala womzambwila mulusona Wauza, “Munhu ija kakulihi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Hakala na minyong'onyo mingi mmabumbila ga wanhu. Wamwenga wolonga, ino “Munhu mtenda goya.” Wamwenga wolonga, “Habule, iyo kowagiza wanhu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Hata ivo habule munhu yagezile kulonga mbuli zake hazelu kwa vija kakala kowadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Lusona uwo vuugendelele kusamhuka, Yesu nayo kengila muing'anda ya Mulungu kasonga kufunda. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Baho Wayahudi wakanganya na kulonga, “Munhu ino kapataze mafundo nayo hafundigwe?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ivo Yesu kawedika, “Mafundo ganifunda sio gangu mbali gake iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Munhu yolonda kusang'hana goyolonda Mulungu, kovimanya kama mafundo gangu golawa kwa Mulungu hebu niye noilongela gangu mwenyego.<verse eid="JHN 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Munhu yoilongela tu mwenyego koilondela nhogolwa yake mwenyego, mbali munhu yolonda nhogolwa kwa ija yamtumile, iyo ni wakutogoligwa, na mgati yake kabule ubananzi wowose. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Ivo, Musa haweng'hile mweye ndagizi? Hata ivo habule imwe mmwenu yaigogile ndagizi ya Musa. Ivo habali molonda kung'homa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Baho wanhu wamlongela, “Gweye kuna chinyamkela! Yalihi yolonda kukukoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu kedika, “Hana uzonza umwe niusang'hane na mweye mose mkanganya.<verse eid="JHN 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa kaweng'heni mazoela ga kwingiza kumbi. Sio kua mazoela gago galawa kwa Musa mbali kwa wasao zenu. Sambi mweye mokwingiza kumbi munhu Mdizua da kuhumula. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ihawa mweye momwingiza kumbi munhu Mdizua da kuhumula ili ndagizi ya Musa sekeibenigwe, habali muhiligwa hebu kwa vija nimhonya munhu lukuli lwake wose Mdizua da kuhumula? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mbali seke mlamule mbuli kwa kunze tu mbali laveni ulamuzi bila kumonela munhu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivo ino iyo Kilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Wanhu wamwenga wa Yelusalemu wakala woiuza, “Ivo ija munhu womzambwila ili wamkome sio ino? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Sambi loleni! Kowalonga wanhu hazelu na habule munhu wa kumlongela hata mbuli. Ivo vodahika kua vilongozi wammanya kweli ino iyo Kilisito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kilisito vonda yeze habule munhu yovimanya hanu hoyolawa mbali cheye chovimanya kuyalawile munhu ino.” <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Baho Yesu viyakalile kofunda haja muing'anda ya Mulungu, kalonga kwa dizi kulu, “Ivo mweye mnimanya hata kunilawile mkumanya? Hata ivo sizile kwa kulonda mwenyego ila kwa ija yanhumile niye iyo waukweli. Mbali hamummanya, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />mbali niye nimmanya kwa vija nilawa kumwake, na iyo yanhumile.” <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Baho wanhu walonda kumgela mmakono gao, mbali habule munhu yoyose yagezile kumwamha kwa vija saa yake ikala ing'hali hainavika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Wanhu wengi mdibumbila dija wakalile haja wamtogola wakala walonga, “Ivo Kilisito yaheza kodaha kusang'hana vilaguso vikulu kubita viyasang'hane munhu ino?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi wotumigwa wamgoge Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo wawahulika wanhu wonyong'onya kulongelela mbuli za Yesu. Baho wao hamwe na wakulu wa Walava nhambiko, wawatuma wanhu waite kumgela mmakono. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Baho Yesu kalonga, “Ning'hali na mweye chipindi chiguhi, amala nobwela kwa ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Monizambwila mbali hamniona, manake haja hondanikale mweye hamdaha kuvika.<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wolongelela wenyego kwa wenyego, “Munhu ino koitahi, mbaka cheye chipotigwe kumpata? Koita kwa Wayahudi wahanganyike na wagiliki na kuwafunda waja Wagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Manake choni kulonga, “Monizambwila mbali hamniona bahaja hondanili hamdaha kuvika.<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzasa za mazi ga ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mdizua da chikomelezo da lusona, ijo dikala zua diliyeka. Yesu kema kenula dizi kalonga, “Yeli na ng'hilu yeze kumwangu yang'we. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kama vigalonga Mayandiko ga Mulungu, ‘Yoyose ija yonhogola niye, nzasa za mazi gaugima gokilima muumoyo wake.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu kalonga ivo mbuli ya Muhe wa Mulungu kua wanhu womtogola yeye wombokela. Chipindi icho Muhe wa Mulungu ukala haunavika, kwa vija iyo Yesu kakala hanatogoligwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu woigola kwa mbuli ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Wanhu wamwenga mwa dija bumbila viwahulike mbuli izo walonga, “Kweli munhu ino iyo ija mlagusi wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Wanhu wamwenga walonga, “Ino ni Kilisito!” Mbali wamwenga wauza, “Ivo, yodahikaze Kilisito kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ivo Mayandiko ga Mulungu hagalonga kua Kilisito koleligwa mulukolo lwa Daudi, na kolawa Betelehemu kae ya Daudi?’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Baho wanhu weli mdibumbila dija waigola kwa mbuli ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Wanhu wamwenga walonda kumgoga, mbali hakalile hata munhu imwe yagezile kumwanha.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi walema kumtogola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Amala waja wamilizi wabwela kwa waja wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na Mafalisayo nawo wawauza, “Habali hamumgogile Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Waja wamilizi wedika na kulonga, “Hambe munhu galu kulonga kama viyolonga munhu ino.<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo wamuuza, ivo, na mweye mwingizigwa muubozi uwo? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mweye mmona hata imwe mwa vilongozi wa wanhu hebu imwe wa Mafalisayo yamtogole? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Mbali bumbila dino da wanhu domtogola munhu iyo, mbali hawazimanyile ndagizi za Musa, ivo wenukiligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Imwe mwa Mafalisayo yokemigwa Nikodemu, ija yaitile kwa Yesu ichilo, kawalongela wayage, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />ivo ndagizi yetu yodaha kumlamula munhu tanhu hawanamtegeleza na kuvimanya kuwa katenda choni?<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nao wamuuza, “Na gweye kulawa Galilaya? Baho kalolese Mayandiko ga Mulungu na gweye koona kuwa Galilaya hakaulawa mlagusi wa Mulungu mbe.<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Baho wose wasegela kila munhu kaita ukae kumwake<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwanachike yagogigwe Ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Mbali Yesu kaita kuchigongo cha Mizeituni.<verse eid="JHN 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Igolo yake imitondo kaita kaidi Muikae ya Mulungu, na wanhu wose wakala wamzunguluka, nayo Yesu kasonga kuwafunda. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wafundaji wa ndagizi za Musa na Mafalisayo wamgala kwa Yesu mwanachike imwe yagogigwe ugoni, wamwika haulongozi wao.<verse eid="JHN 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Baho wamuuza, “Mfundaji, mwanachike ino kagogigwa muugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mzindagizi zetu za Musa yochilagiza kwa mbuli kama ino, mwanachike ino yatoigwe mabwe mbaka yadanganike, na gweye kolongaze? <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Nao wamuuza mbuli iyo kuno womgeza ili wadahe kumlongeleza. Mbali Yesu kainamila hasi na kwandika kwa chidole haja hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Viwagendelele kumuuza ng'hani, nayo Yesu kenuka na kuwalongela, “Kama hana munhu yoyose mmwenu yabule malozo yalongole kumpigisila dibwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Kainamila kaidi, na kwandika muiisi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Viwahulike mbuli iyo, wasonga kusegela imwe imwe, walongola wavele mbaka Yesu kakala yasigale yaiyeka, na ija mwanachike kema haulongozi hake. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu viyenuke kamuuza ija mwanachike, “Mama wakulihi waja wanhu wakulongeleze kumwangu? Ivo, habule hata munhu imwe yakulongele?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ija mwanachike kalonga, Muhenga habule hata munhu imwe. Nayo Yesu kamlongela, ivija niye sikulamula. Genda zako, na kulawa sambi sekeutende malozo kaidi.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ni bung'hulo da isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Amala Yesu kawalongela kaidi, niye iyo bung'hulo da wanhu wa isi, yoniwinza niye hogenda mdiziza mbe, mbali kokua na bung'hulo da ugima.<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafalisayo wamlongela, “Gweye koilongela mwenyego, kwaivo icho chuuilongela mwenyego hachitogoligwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu kedika kawalongela, “Hata kama niye noilongela mwenyego, nokimanya chinilonga, kwa vija nokumanya kulihi kunilawile na kulihi kuniita. Mbali mweye hamkumanya kunilawile na hamkumanya kuniita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mweye momlamula munhu kama wanhu viwalamula, mbali niye simlamula munhu yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Hata nihamlamula munhu, ulamuzi wangu wofaya, kwa vija silamula niiyeka, mbali nolamula hamwe na Tata yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Mzindazi zenu yandikigwa kua, galongigwe wa wanhu waidi gotogoligwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Niye noilongela mwenyego, nayo Tata yanhumile, konilongelela ivija.<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Baho wamuuza, “Tati yako kakulihi?” Yesu kawedika, “Mweye hamnimanya niye, kama mhanimanyile nie mhammanyile na Tati yangu ivija.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu kakala kofunda gago viyakalile yofunda Haing'anda ya Mulungu behi na sanduku da kwikila nhosa, na ivija hawamvikile munhu yamgogile kwa vija saa yake ikala ing'hali kuvika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuniita mweye hamdaha kuvika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu kawalongela kaidi, “Niye nosegela, na mweye monizambwila na mofa mmalozo genu. Kuja kuniita niye mweye hamdaha kuvika.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Baho vilongozi wa Wayahudi waiuza, ‘Ivo, koita koikoma? Habali kalonga kuniita mweye hamdaha kwiza?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye molawa bahano hasi muiisi na niye nilawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. Mweye mwawaisi ino, na niye sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Iyo mana niwalongeleni mweye mofa mmalozo genu, na mofa mmalozo genu kama hamtogola kua, “Niye iyo nilongigwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nao wamuuza, “Gweye iyo nani?” Yesu kawalongela, “Niwalongeleni kulawa haumwanduso. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ning'hali na mbuli nyingi za kuwalongela na kuwalamula. Mbali ija yanhumile ni mkweli, na niye nowalongela wanhu wa isi gaja tu ganihulike kulawa kumwake.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Hawavimanyile kua kakala kowalongela mbuli ya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Muhamwinula Mwana wa Munhu mumbiki, ivo monda mvimanye kua, ‘Niye iyo,’ sidaha kusang'hana chochose chinilonda niiyeka, mbali nolonga vija tu Tata viyanifundile. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Na iyo yanhumile kahamwe na niye, hananileka niiyeka, kwa vija mmazua gose nosang'hana gaja gayanogeligwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Wanhu wengi viwahulike Yesu viyalonga gago wamtogola.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweli yomwikeni kuilegeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ivo Yesu kawalongela waja Wayahudi wamtogole, “Muhayagoga mafundo gangu kweli mokua waluko wangu, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />moimanya kweli nayo kweli yomwikeni kuilegeha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nao wamwidika, “Cheye wa ulelo wa Abulahamu,” na hachinapata mbe kua watumwa wa munhu yoyose ija. Baho choni kuchilongela, ‘Chokala bila utumwa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni kweli, chila munhu yotenda malozo iyo mtumwa wa malozo. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mtumwa hakala ukae mazua gose, mbali mwana kokala ukae mazua galibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ivo Mwana yahamtendani kuilegeha, na mweye moilegeha kweli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Niye novimanya mweye uwo ulelo wa Abulahamu, hata ivo monda kung'homa kwavija mafundo gangu gabule nyafasi mmoyo wenu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Niye nolonga gaja ganionile vinikalile na Tata na mweye ivija mosangang'hana gaja gamuhulike kulawa kwa tati yenu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Nao wamwidika, “Cheye wanage Abulahamu!” Yesu kawalongela, “Mwahawile wana wa Abulahamu, “Mwahasang'hane kama viyasang'hane Abulahamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Mbali mweye monda kung'homa, munhu niwalongele ukweli uja unihulike kulawa kwa Mulungu, ila Abulahamu hatendile ivo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mweye mosang'hana mbuli zija ziyasang'hana Tata yenu.” Wamwidika, “Cheye hachili wana wa ugoni! China tata imwe tu, iyo Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mulungu kama yahawile Tata yenu, muhawile nawende naniye, manake niye nilawa kwa iyo Mulungu na vino sambi nabaha. Niye sizile mbe kwa udaho wangu mwenyego, mbali niza kwa udaho wa iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Habali hamgamanya gano ganilonga? Kwa vija hamgagesa mafundo gangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mweye mwa wana wa tata yenu Chinyamkela, na molonda kusang'hana maya za tata yenu. Iyo kakala yokoma kulawa haumwanduso, hadaha kuwimila ukweli, kwa vija ukweli wenyego wa habule mgati yake. Chila viyolonga uvwizi kolonga kama vigali mazoela gake na mwenyego iyo Tata wa uvwizi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kwavija nolonga ukweli, mweye hamnitogola. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Yalihi mmwenu yonda yagangamize kua niye munhu nili na malozo? Kama nowalongela kweli, habali hamtogola vinilonga? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yoyose ija yolawa kwa Mulungu hutegeleza Usenga wa Mulungu, mbali mweye hamtegeleza Usenga wa Mulungu kwavija mweye hamlawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakala kabula ya Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi wamuuza Yesu, “Ivo, hachilonga kweli kua gweye Msamalia na kaidi kuna chinyamkela?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu kawedika kalonga, “Niye nabule chinyamkela mbali niye nomtegeleza Tata yangu, na mweye hamnitegeleza. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Niye silonda ukulu wangu mwenyego, kabaho imwe yolonilondela ukulu uwo, nayo iyo mlamuzi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nowalongeleni kweli, munhu yahategeleza mafundo gangu hadanganika mazua gose galibule uhelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Wayahudi wamlongela Yesu, “Kweli chivimanya kua gweye kuna chinyamkela. Abulahimu kakala kadanganika, na walagusi ivija wadanganika, na gweye kolonga kua, ‘Yoyose youtegeleza Usenga wangu hadanganika mazua gose.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ivo, kotenda kwa mkulu kubita tati yetu Ibulahamu ija yadanganike? Hata Walagusi wa Mulungu wadanganika. Kokwagiza gweye nani?<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu kawalongela, nahaitogola mwenyego, nhogolwa yangu sio chinhu. Tati yangu iyo yonitogola, ija na mweye molonga Mulungu wenu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Manake mweye hamummanyile mbali niye nimmanya. Kama nihalonga simmanyile, nokua mvwizi kama mweye. Niye nommanya na kusang'hana chiyalonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abulahimu tata yenu kavina galigali adione zua jangu nayo kadiona, kadeng'helela.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Baho Wayahudi wamuuza, “Gweye hunavika milao hamsini, na gweye kumwona Abulahimu?<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, “Kabula ya Abulahamu hanavumbuka, ‘Niye nabaha.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Baho wadondola mabwe weze kumtoa, mbali Yesu kaibanga, kalawa haja haing'anda ya Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaleligwe chipofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile kobita kamona munhu imwe yakalile chipofu kulawa viyaleligwe.<verse eid="JHN 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Waluko wake wamuuza, “Mfundaji, yelihi yeli na malozo, munhu ino hebu Tati na mami yake mbaka yaleligwe chipofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu kedika, mbuli ino hailawile kwa malozo gake ino hebu malozo ga tata na mami yake, mbali kaleligwa chipofu ili udaho wa Mulungu uwoneke muugima wake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Cholondeka kusang'hana sang'hano za ija yachitumile ing'hali imisi, kwa vija chilo yokwiza habule munhu yoyose yoodaha kusang'hana sang'hano.<verse eid="JHN 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Nihawa muuisi ino niye iyo bung'hulo da isi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, katema mate gake hasi, kasang'hana nhope kwa gaja mate gake, amala kasola nhope kamhaka mzing'hope za ija munhu chipofu,<verse eid="JHN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />amala Yesu kamlongela munhu ija, “Genda kasunhe chihanga chako mdilamba da Siloamu.” Zina Siloamu manake yatumigwe. Na ija munhu chipofu, kaita kusunha chihanga chake amala kabwela yolola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Baho wanhu waja wokala behi na ukae yake na wanhu wamwenga wamwonile umwaka yopula, wasonga kuiuza wenyego, ivo, ino sio ija chikumbi muyega yakalile kopula wanhu mnzila? <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Wamwenga walonga, “Iyo yeye.” Wamwenga walonga, “Bule sio ino! mbali waigala.” Nayo ija yaakalile chipofu kalonga, “Iyo niye!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Baho wamuuza, “Ilawilaze mbaka sambi kolola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nayo kedika, “Munhu imwe yokemigwa Yesu kavunyanga nhope, kanibaka mchihanga amala kanongela, ‘Genda Siloamu kasunhe chihanga chako.’ Baho, niye niita nisunha chihanga na vino sambi nolola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Wamuuza, “Kakulihi munhu iyo?” Munhu ija kalonga, “Mmane!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wozambwila mbuli ya kuhonyigwa chipofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Amala wamgala munhu ija yakalile chipofu mbaka kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Zua Yesu viyavunyange ija nhope na kumuhonya munhu ija yakalile chipofu dikala zua da kuhumula.<verse eid="JHN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Baho Mafalisayo nawo wasonga kumuuza viyahonyigwe. Nayo kawalongela, “Yesu kavunyanga nhope na kunibaka mmameso ivo sambi nolola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo wamwenga walonga, “Munhu ino halawile kwa Mulungu kwa vija hadimanya zua da kuhumula.” Wamwenga walonga, “Munhu yeli na malozo kodahaze kutenda chilaguso kama chino?” Baho wasonga kuleka kuitogolela.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Wamuuza kaidi munhu ija yakalile chipofu, “Kwa vija iyo kakutenda ulole, na gweye komlongelelaze munhu iyo?” Nayo kawalongela, “Iyo mlagusi wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi hawatogole kama munhu ija kakala chipofu kulawa viyaleligwe na sambi kolola, mbali hawatogole mbaka viwawakemile tata na mami yake. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Baho wawauza tata na mami yake, walonga, “Ivo ino iyo mwanenu yumlonga kaleligwa chipofu? Ivo sambi kapataze kulola?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Tata na mami yake walonga, “Chovimanya kua ino iyo mwanetu na kaleligwa chipofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Mbali kapataze kulola, hachivimanyile hebu yamfumbule meso hachimmanya. Muuzeni mwenyego, kwa vija iyo ni mkulu na kodaha kuilongela mbuli iyo mwenyego!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Tata na mami yake walonga ivo manake wawadumba waja vilongozi wa Wayahudi kwa vija vilongozi hao wailalika kua, munhu yoyose, yonda yalonge kua Yesu iyo Kilisito kokimiligwa kumfugamila Mulungu Muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Iyo mana tata na mami yake walonga, “Iyo mkulu mgima muuzeni mwenyego!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Mala ya kaidi wamkema munhu ija yakalile chipofu na wamlongela, “Mtogole Mulungu kua kolonga ukweli! Kwa vija cheye chovimanya munhu ino kana malozo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Munhu iyo kawedika, “Kama kana malozo niye sivimanya. Mbali chinhu chimwe tu chinimanya, ng'hala chipofu na sambi nolola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Baho wamuuza, “Kakutendendela choni? Kakuhonyaze meso gako?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Munhu iyo kawedika, “Nimala kuwalongela na mweye hamnihulike. Habali molonda kuhulika kaidi? Hebu mweye ivija monda kua waluko wake?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Mbali wao wamliga, “Wamlongela kama gweye iyo mwaluko wake, na cheye iyo waluko wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Cheye chivimanya kua Mulungu kalonga na Musa, mbali munhu ino hachimanya kuyalawile!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nayo kawedika kawalongela, “Uno ni uzonza! Mweye hamvimanya kuyalawile, mbali kanihonya meso gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ija yakalile chipofu kalonga, “Chose chovimanya kua Mulungu hawahulika wanhu weli na malozo, mbali Mulungu kumhulika munhu yoyose yomfugamila na kusang'hana goyolonda.<verse eid="JHN 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kulawa mwaka muuisi, hachina hulika mbe, munhu yamuhonyile munhu yaleligwe chipofu yadahe kulola. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Mbali kama munhu iyo halawile kuulanga kwa Mulungu, wahapotigwe kusang'hana chinhu kama chino.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Wao wamwidika, “Gweye kuvumbuka uli mmalonzo, kodahaze kuchifunda cheye?” Baho wamuwinga kulawa muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wopotigwa kuumanya ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu viyahulike munhu ija yamuhonyile meso kawingigwa kunze, baho viyamting'hane kamuuza, “Ivo gweye komtogola Mwana wa Munhu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Munhu ija kedika, “Go mkulu, nilongele iyo nani nimtogole!” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu kamlongela, “Kumona na yuulonga nayo iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Baho munhu ija kalonga, “Nhogola Mndewa!” Kamtumbalila mavindi na kumwinamila mbaka hasi.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu kalonga, “Niye niza muno muuisi kulamula, ili vipofu wadahe kuona na waja woona wawe vipofu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wakalile habehi nayo, wazihulika mbuli izo na kumuuza, “Ivo, cheye ivija vipofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu kawedika, “Maza mwahawile vipofu, mwahawile bule malozo, mbali sambi mweye molonga, ‘Cheye choona,’ na iyo yolagusa kua mng'hali na ubananzi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulinga msusilaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongeleni kweli, yoyose kama hengile mdizizi da ng'hondolo kwa kubitila muulwivi, mbali kokwingila kubitila nzila imwenga iyo ni mbavi na mbokaji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Mbali yokwingila muulwivi iyo Msusilaji wa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mkaliza lwivi komvugulila, na ng'hondolo wohulika dizi jake, nayo kowakema ng'hondolo chila imwe kwa zina jake, na kuwalava kunze. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Yahamala kuwalava wose kunze, yeye huwalongolela nao nghondolo womuwinza kwa vija wodimanya dizi jake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Mbali ng'hondolo hao hawadaha kumuwiza nyambenyambe, mbali womkimbila kwa vija hawaimanya dizi yake.<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu kawalongela kulinga mbuli kuno, mbali wao hawachimanyile chayalondile kuwalongela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo msusilaji yanogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Baho Yesu kalonga nao kaidi, “Nowalongelani kweli, niye ni lwivi lwa ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Waja wose wezile kabula ya niye wabavi na wabokaji, nao ng'hondolo hawawamanya. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Niye na lwivi, yokwingila kubitila niye koloholigwa, kokwingila na kulawa na kopata hanhu ha kudila. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbavi kokwiza kwa mbuli ya kwiba na kukoma na kubananga, mbali niye niza ili mpate ugima ulibule uhelelo, kaidi mukale na ugima ugangamale.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Niye na msusilaji yanogile. Msusilaji yanogile koulava ugima yalinao kwa mbuli ya ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Munhu wa chitumetume ija sio msusilaji, na ng'hondolo sio wake, munhu iyo yahamona mbweha kokwiza, kowaleka ng'hondolo na kukimbila, amala mbweha kowagoga ng'hondolo na kuwapwililisa.<verse eid="JHN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Munhu hagesa chinhu kwa mbuli ya ng'hondolo kwa vija iyo munhu wa chitumetume tu.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15" />Niye na msusilaji yanogile. Nowamanya ng'hondolo wangu na ng'holo wangu ivija wonimanya niye, kama vija Tata viyanimanyile niye, na niye vinimmanya Tata. Niye noulava ugima wangu kwa mbuli ya ng'hondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kaidi nina ng'hondolo wamwenga mbali sio wa zizi dino, nao ivija nolondeka kuwagala hanili. Nao wodimanya dizi jangu, baho hokua na bumbila dimwe na msusilaji imwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Kwambuli ino, “Tati yangu kana wende na niye kwa vija noulava ugima wangu, ili nize kuubokela kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Habule munhu yondaniboke ugima nilinao, mbali noulava kwa vinilonda mwenyego. Nodaha kuulava ugima nilinao ivija nodaha kuubweleza ugima uwo kaidi. Vino ivo Tata viyanilagize kusang'hana.<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kwa mbuli zino za Yesu kulawila kaidi Wayahudi kuleka kuitogolela. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Wanhu wengi walonga, “Ino kana chinyamkela kaidi kana chichala! Yachoni kumtegeleza?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Wamwenga walonga, “Mbuli zino si za yambule chinyamkela. Ivo, chinyamkela kodaha kuhonya meso vipofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa na Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Uko Yelusalemu kukala na lusona lwa kuinang'hana kaidi Ng'anda ya Mulungu kwambuli ya Mndewa. Chipindi icho chikala cha mbeho. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Nayo Yesu kakala yogenda Muing'anda ya Mulungu haluhelengo lwa Solomoni,<verse eid="JHN 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />baho bumbila da wanhu waikunzanya hamwe na wamuuza, “Kochileka chitonga vino mbaka zua gani? Kama gweye iyo Kilisito chilongele bila kuchifisa.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu kawedika, “Niwalongeleni mbali hamtogole. Sang'hano zinisang'hana niye kwa udaho wa Tata yangu zonilongelela niye nani. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Mbali mweye hamtogola kwa vija mweye sio ng'hondolo wangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ng'hondolo wangu ohulika dizi yangu na niye nowamanya nao woniwinza. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Niye noweng'ha ugima ulibule uhelelo, nao hokwaga mbe, na ivija habule munhu yondayawa lava kulawa mmakono yake. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tati yangu yaning'hile wano ni mkulu kubita wose, hebu habule yodaha kuwalawa mmakono gake Tata. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Niye na Tati yangu chiilumba.<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Baho Wayahudi wasola mabwe ili wamtoe. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Niye niwasang'hanileni sang'hano nyingi kulawa kwa Tata. Ilihi mwaizo imtendani mnhoe mabwe?<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi wamlongela cheye hachikutoa mabwe kwa sang'hano zinogile uzisang'hane, mbali chokutoa mabwe kwa mbuli ya kumliga Mulungu! Manake kuitenda gweye kwa Mulungu mbali kumbe gweye kwa munhu kama cheye.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu kawauza, ivo, “Hayandikigwe mzindagizi zenu kua niye nilonga, ‘Mweye muilinga na Mulungu?’<verse eid="JHN 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ihawa Mulungu kawakema waja yaweng'hile usenga wake kua waigala na Mulungu, na cheye chivimanya kua Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga kweli mazua gose. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Ivo, ija Tata yamsimike na kumgala muisi, momlongela, ‘Koliga,’ eti kwa vija nilonga, ‘Niye Mwana wa Mulungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Kama sizisang'hana sang'hano za Tati yangu, mweye sekemnitogole. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Mbali nahazisang'hana, hata kama hamnitogola, basi zitogoleni izo sang'hano ili mvimanye kua Tata kamgati yangu na niye namgati yake.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Baho wageza kaidi kumgoga, mbali kawapulusuka mmakono gao.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu kaita kaidi kaloka umwambu mwa lwanda lwa Yoludani, hanhu haja Yohana hayakalile kobatiza, nayo kakala uko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Wanhu wengi wamuwinza Yesu walonga, “Yohana hatendile chilaguso chochose, “Mbali gaja gose gayalongile Yohana kwa mbuli ya munhu ino ni ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Wanhu wengi baho wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kudanganika kwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Hakala na munhu imwe yokemigwa Lazalo, mwenekae wa Betania, iyo kakala mtamu. Chijiji cha Betania chikala hanhu hawakalile Malia na Mata mdodo wake. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Ino Malia iyo ija yambakile Mndewa mavuta ga chinung'hila ga bei ng'hulu na kumhangusa magulu kwa mvili zake.<verse eid="JHN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Baho lumbu zake wamtumila usenga Yesu na kumlongela, “Mndewa mbwigaako mkulu mtamu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Mbali Yesu viyahulike gago kalonga, “Lazalo hadanganika kwa utamu uno, mbali kwa mbuli ya Mulungu kutogoligwa, kalumwa ili kwa nzila iyo Mwana wa Mulungu yatogoligwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu kakala na ubwiga mkulu na Mata na Malia na lumbujao Lazalo.<verse eid="JHN 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Viyapatile usenga kua Lazalo mtamu, Yesu kakala uko kwa mazua maidi kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Vigabitile mazua gago, kawalongela waluko wake, “Aya chiteni kaidi Yudea.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Waluko wake wamlongela, “Mfundaji, chipindi chiguhi chibita waja Wayahudi walonda kukukoma kwa mabwe, na gweye konda kubweleganya uko kaidi?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu kedika, “Ivo saa za imisi si masaa kumi na maidi? Baho munhu yahagenda imisi hadaha kuikwala, kwa vija kodiona bung'hulo da isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Mbali kama wanhu wahagenda ichilo woikwala kwa vija habule bung'hulo dakuwabung'hulila.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, Yesu kawalongela, “Mbwiga yetu Lazalo kawasa ivo noita kumlamusa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Baho Waluko wake wamlongela, “Mndewa kama kweli munhu iyo kawasa basi kolamka tu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu kakala yolonga mbuli ya ifa ya Lazalo, mbali waluko wake hawavimanyile, wao watonga kua Lazalo kawasa utulo.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Ivo Yesu kawalongela bila kufisa kua, “Lazalo kadanganika, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />mbali nodeng'helela kwa mbuli yenu kwa vija sikalile uko haja Lazalo viyakalile yang'hali kudanganika, ili mdahe kutogola haya chiteni kumwake.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomaso yokemigwa pacha kawalongela waluko wayage, “Haya na cheye chiteni chikadanganike hamwe na Mndewa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo uzilibuko na Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu viyavikile uko, kavika Lazalo kakala mazua mane gabita kulawa viyawandigwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Mbali chijiji cha Betania ikala behi na Yelusalemu kama utali wa kilometa nhatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Wayahudi wengi weza kwa Mata na Malia kuhani kwa ifa ya lumbujao.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ivo Mata viyehulike Yesu kokwiza, kaita kumbokela, mbali Malia kasigala bahaja ukae. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mata kamlongela Yesu, “Mndewa maza ukalile hano, lumbujangu sambi yadanganike. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Mbali novimanya kua hata sambi chochose chiumpula Mulungu kokwing'ha.<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu kamlongela, “Lumbujako kozilibuka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Mata kamwidika, “Novimanya kua kozilibuka chipindi cha uzilibuko zua da uhelelo.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu kamlongela, “Niye iyo uzilibuko na ugima. munhu yonda yanitogole niye hata yahadanganika kokua mgima kaidi, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na yoyose yeli na ugima na yonhogola niye, hadanganika mbe. Ivo, koditogola dino?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Mata kamlongela,“Enaa, Mndewa nitogola kua gweye iyo Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu, Mwana wa Mulungu, ija yokwiza Muuisi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlilila Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Mata viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, kaita kumkema Malia mdodo wake na wainega kamlongela, “Mfundaji kabaha, kokukema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia viyahulike ulonzi uwo, bahaja kenuka, kaita kwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu kakala hanakwingila mchijiji, mbali kakala yang'hali bahaja Mata hayambokele. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Baho waja Wayahudi wezile kuhani wakalile ukae hamwe na Malia viwamonile bahaja kenuka na kulawa kunze, wamuwinza. Wagiza koita kuja kudipanga kulilila uko.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Na Malia viyavikile hanhu haja hayakalile Yesu, kafugama mafindi, na kumlongela, “Mndewa maza ukalile hano lumbujangu sambi yadanganike!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu viyamonile Malia kolila na waja Wayahudi yezile nawo wolila, kengila giogio na fufunhende mmoyo. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Amala Yesu kawauza, “Mmuwanda halihi?” Wamlongela, “Mndewa izo uhalole.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu kalila mbaka kalava mahozi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Baho, Wayahudi walonga, “Loleni viyeli na wende nayo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Mbali wamwenga wauza, “Ivo, ino iyo yamhonyile meso chipofu, nayo hadahile kutenda ino Lazalo sekeyafe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Baho Yesu kakala na giogio mmoyo wake kaidi, kavika kudipanga. Ijo panga dikala mhango ivija digubikigwa na dibwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu kalonga, “Disegezeni ijo dibwe.” Nayo ija Mata lumbujake yadanganike kamlongela, “Mndewa kasonga kunung'ha, manake kakala mdipanga sambi zua da kane!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu kamlongela Mata, “Ivi sikulongele kua wahatogola kouona ukulu wa Mulungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Baho wadisegeza dija dibwe. Yesu kalola kuchanha kuulanga kwa Mulungu kapula kalonga, “Nokwing'ha hewela Tata kwa vija gweye konihulika.” <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Novimanya kua gweye mmazua gose konihulika. Mbali nilonga gano kwa mbuli ya wanhu wali hano ili wadahe kutogola kua gweye iyo unhumile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kamkeka kwa dizi kulu, “Lazalo lawa kunze!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Ija yakalile yadanganike kalawa kunze, kuno kafungigwa mmagulu na mmakono, na mchihanga chake chigubikigwa chitambala. Baho Yesu kawalongela mvuguleni na mlekeni yaite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Wayahudi weka chigwena cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maluko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ivo, Wayahudi wengi wezile na Malia, viwaonile mbuli iyo iyasang'hane Yesu wamtogola. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Mbali wamwenga waita kwa Mafalisayo na kuwalongela mbuli ziyasang'hane Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kwa ivo waja wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na Mafalisayo wakema chigwena waiuza, “Chitendeze? manake munhu ino kosang'hana vilaguso vingi ng'hani!” <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Chahamleka yagendelele kusang'hana vilaguso vino, chila munhu komtogola, baho Wakulu wa Loma wokwiza kuchibanangila ukulu kwa mbuli ya Ng'anda ya Mulungu na isi yetu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Munhu imwe mmwao yokemigwa Kayafa, ija yakalile Mkulu wa nhambiko mlao uwo kalonga, “Mweye hammanya chinhu chochose! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ivo, mweye hamuona yofaya kumwenu munhu imwe yafe kwa mbuli ya wanhu wamwenga, kubita wanhu wa isi yose wakomigwe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Nayo hailongile mbuli iyo kwa viyolonda mwenyego, mbali kazilonga mbuli izo kama Mkulu wa nhambiko wa mlao uwo. Kakala yagesile kua Yesu kodanganika kwa mbuli ya isi ya Wayahudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />hebu sio kua kodanganika kwa mbuli ya weli Wayahudi waiyeka, mbali kwa mbuli ya wana wa Mulungu wapwililike, ivija yawakunzanye na kuweka hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ivo kulawa zua ijo waja Vilongozi wa Wayahudi wasonga kuilumba hamwe kulonda kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwaivo Yesu hagendelele kugenda hazelu kaidi mwa Wayahudi, mbali kainega kaita hanhu hakalile na chiwala, mbaka kae ikemigwa Efulahimu, kakala uko hamwe na Waluko wake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Lusona lwa Wayahudi lwa Pasaka vuukalile habehi, wanhu wengi walawa mzikae zao waita Yelusalemu kuitanda kabula ya lusona uno. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Basi wakala womzambwila Yesu, nao viwaikunyanye hamwe Muing'anda ya Mulungu, waiuza, “Moonaze? yooneka kua munhu ino heza kabisa mulusona hebu sio?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Baho wakulu wa nhambiko na Mafalisayo wakala walava malagizo kua munhu yoyose yahamona Yesu kuyeli, yawalongele wakulu ili wamgele mmakono.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maliam kombaka Yesu mavuta ga kunung'ila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mazua sita kabula ya lusona lwa Pasaka, Yesu kavika Betania, kwaakalile Lazalo ija yazilibuligwe na Yesu kulawa kwa wafile. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Uko wamtandila Yesu ndiya ya chigulogulo, Mata kakala yowasang'hanila. Nayo Lazalo kakala imwe mwa waja wakalile woja hamwe na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Amala Malia kasola nusu ya lita ya mavuta ya kinhung'hila cha bei ng'hulu ng'hani, kambaka Yesu magulu na kumuhangusa kwa mvili zake. Ng'anda yose imema chinung'hila mavuta gago. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Baho Yuda Isikaliote, imwe mwawaluko kumi na waidi ija yonda yamhinduke Yesu kalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Habali hamgagulile gago mavuta kwa chitumetume cha mazua mia cha chibalua wa mzengaji, na sente izo muweng'he vikumbi muyega?”<verse eid="JHN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuda kalonga ivo, si kwa vija kuwagesa ng'hani vikumbi muyega, mbali kwa vija kakala mgoga kadi, mbali kwa vija kakala mbavi. Mala kwa mala kakala yokwiba kulawa mwaiyo kadi.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Mbali Yesu kalonga, “Sekemumgaze mwanachike ino, mlekeleni anitande kwa mbuli ya ifa yangu.<verse eid="JHN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Vikumbi muyega mnao mazua gose, mbali hamkala na niye mazua gose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi weka chigwena cha kumkoma Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wengi wahulika kua Yesu kakala uko Betania. Ivo, wavika uko sio tu kwa mbuli ya kumuona Yesu, mbali ivija wapate kumwona Lazalo ija yazilibuligwe na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Ivo wakulu wa Walava nhambiko weka chigwena ivija cha kumkoma Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwa mbuli ya Lazalo, Wayahudi wengi wawaleka vilongozi wao na wamtogola Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalem kwa galigali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Na zua da kaidi yake vidivikile, wanhu wengi wezile muulusona uja, wahulika kua Yesu kamnzila kwiza Yelusalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Baho wasola makwamvi ga mibiki ya mitende, waita kumbokela kuno wenula dizi jao wolonga,“Atogoligwe Mulungu! Kamweda iyo yokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa. Yamwede Mfaume wa Izilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Nayo Yesu kapata mwana wa mhunda imwe na kakwela kumgongo kama Mayandiko vigalonga.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Nekemdumbe wenekae wa Yelusalem, lola mfaume wenu kokwiza kakwela mwana mhunda! <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Chipindi icho Waluko wake Yesu hawazimanyile mbuli izo, mbali Yesu viyamalile kwing'higwa nhogolwa, ivo wavimanyile kua gago gakala gandikgwe kwa mbuli yake na wanhu wakala wamtendela iyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Na waja wakalile hamwe na Yesu viyamkemile Lazalo na kumzilibula, wagendelela kulonga gagaja galawilile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kwaivo wanhu wengi wambokela, manake wose wahulika kua Yesu kasang'hana chilaguso icho.<verse eid="JHN 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Ivo Mafalisayo viwaonile gago wailongelela, moona hano hachidaha kusang'hana chochose, kwa vija loleni wanhu wa isi yose womuwinza!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela mbuli ya ifa na kuzilibuka kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Baho hakala na Wayunani wamwenga mdibumbila da wanhu waitile kuja Yelusalemu kufugama mulusona wa msimo uwo. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Baho wagiliki wao waita kwa Filipo, munhu wa Betisaida uko Galilaya, na kulonga, “Go mkulu cholonda kumwona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Nayo Filipo kaita kumlongela Andelea, nayo Andelea na Filipo wose waidi wamlongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Saa ya kutogoligwa Mwana wa Munhu ivika.<verse eid="JHN 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nowalongeleni kweli, mhule ya ngano yosigala ivo tu, kama haigwile muulongo na kufa na kota. Ihafa baho yolela mhule nyingi.<verse eid="JHN 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Wanhu woulonda ugima wao kowagiza na woulema ugima wao muisi ino wowika kwa mbuli ya ugima ulibule uhelelo.<verse eid="JHN 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Munhu yolonda kunhumikila niye, kolondeka yaniwinze, manake hohose hanili niye, baho na mtumigwa wangu hondayawe. Munhu yoyose yonisang'hanila niye, Tati yangu komtegeleza.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela kwa mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Sambi moyo wangu ugwa fufunhende, mmane nilonge choni? Ivo, nilonge, ‘Tata nilohole nilawe mgamadununzo gago?’ habule, kwavija niza ili nidanganike kwa mbuli ya wamwenga. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tata zina jako ditogoligwe. Baho dizi ilonga kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, “Niditogola na noditogola kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Basi dija bumbila da wanhu dikalile hanhu haja, wahulika dizi ija, wamwenga walonga,“Uwo mbumo.” Mbali wamwenga walonga, “Iyo mtumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu kalonga nayo.” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Ijo dizi imuhulike hailawile kwa mbuli mbali kwambuli yenu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Sambi icho chipindi wanhu wa isi ino kulamuligwa na iyo mkulu wa isi ino kohinduligwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Niye nihatumbikigwa mumbiki, nowakwega wanhu wose kumwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu kagalonga gose kulagusa ni ifa gani yonda yafe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Baho wanhu wengi haho wamwidika, “Cheye cholongiligwa mzindagizi zetu kua Kilisito yasaguligwe na Mulungu kokala mazua gose halibule uhelelo. Gweye kolongaze kua Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka yatumbikigwe mumbiki? Mwana wa Munhu iyo nani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Bung'hulo ding'hali na mweye chipindi chiguhi, gendeni kwa vija mng'hali na ijo bung'hulo ili ziza sekediwavike, manake munhu yotembela mdiziza hakumanya kuyoita. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Basi chipindi mnajo bung'hulo ditogoleni ili muwe wanhu wa bung'hulo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu kopula kwambuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Viyakomeleza kulonga gago Yesu kainenga na kaita kuifisa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hata kama Yesu kasang'hana uzonza mwingi hamwao, mbali hawamtogole.<verse eid="JHN 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ivo usenga uyalongile Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu uvikila, “Mndewa nani yautogole usenga wetu na udaho wa Mndewa wa kulohola kalagusigwa nani?<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ivo hawadahile kutogola manake Isaya kaulonga kaidi.<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mulungu kawatenda sekewalole, kaugela ubozi ubala wao, seke waone kwa meso gao hebu seke wavimanye kwa ubala wao na sekewanihindukile kolonga Mndewa ili mhate kuwahonya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya kalonga usenga uno kwa vija kauona ukulu wa Yesu, na kalonga mbuli zake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Hata ivo vilongozi wengi wa Wayahudi wamtogola Yesu. Mbali kwa mbuli ya Mafalisayo, hawalongile hazelu kwa kudumba kua wobaguligwa Muing'anda ya Kuiting'hanila Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Wao walonda kutogoligwa na wanhu kubita kutogoligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keza kuwalohola wanhu isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Amala Yesu kalonga kwa dizi kulu, “Munhu yonitogola niye, hanitogola niye niiyeka, mbali kumtogola ivija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yanionile niye, kamuona ivija ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Niye niza ili wanhu wadimanye bung'hulo dilawa muukweli wa Mulungu ili wose wonitogola niye sekewakale mdiziza da kuleka kuumanya ukweli wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yoihulika mbuli yangu na hautegeleze niye simulamula, manake sizile kulamula wanhu wa isi, mbali kuwalohola. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Munhu ija yonilema na hagogile usenga wangu kanayo wa kumlamula, usenga uja niulongile uwo wonda mlamule mdizua dilibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Manake silongile kwa mbuli yangu mwenyego, mbali Tati yangu yanhumile, iyo yanilagize chilihi cha kulonga na nichilonge vilihi.<verse eid="JHN 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na niye nozimanya ndagizi zake ni ugima ulibule uhelelo. Baho niye nolonga gaja tu Tata gayanilagize nigalonge.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowasunha Waluko wake magulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Baho viivikile behi na lusona lwa Pasaka. Yesu kakala yomanya chipindi chake chivika wa kusegela muiisi ino na kuita kwa Tati yake. Nayo kakala na wende mazua gose na wanhu wake weli muiisi, enaa kaweng'ha wende mazua gose mbaka kulava ugima ugima wake. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Baho Yesu na waluko wake viwakalile woja ndiya ya chigulogulo, nayo chinyamkela kakala kakomeleza kumgela Yuda Isikaliote mwanage Simoni moyo wihile, ili yadahe kumhinduka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Kuno Yesu kovimanya kua Tati yake kamwing'ha vose mmakono gage, na ivija kakala yalawile kwa Mulungu na kobwela kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Baho kasegela kulawa muindia, kavula chivalo chake cha kunze, kasola chivalo chimwenga kaizinga mchigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Amala kagida mazi mdibakuli, kasonga kuwasunha migulu Waluko wake na kuihangusa ija migulu kwa chija chitambala chiyavalile. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Viyamvikile kwa Simoni Petulo, nayo Petulo kalonga, “Mndewa, ivo! gweye konisunha niye migulu?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye huchimanya sambi chinisang'hana, mbali kokimanya hamwande.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petulo kamlongela, “Gweye hunisunha niye magulu mbe!” Yesu kamwidika, “Kama sikusunhile hudaha kuilumba na niye kaidi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petulo kalonga, “Mndewa nisunhe, sio magulu tu, mbali na makono na ditwi jangu ivija!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu kamlongela, “Munhu yamalile koga, halondeka kaidi mbali kuisunha magulu iiyeka, manake kamala kunang'hana lukuli lose. Mweye mnang'hana, mbali siwose.”<verse eid="JHN 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu kakala kammanya munhu ija yonda yamuhinduke, iyo mana kalonga, “Mweye mnang'hana mbali siwose.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesu viyakomeleze kuwasunha magulu na kuvala kaidi valo jake, kabwela haja hayakalile muindiya kawalongela, “Ivo, mgamanya ganiwasang'hanile? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mweye monikema niye Mfundaji na Mndewa, molonga goya kwa vija niye iyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ihawa niye iyo Mfundaji na Mndewa wenu niwasunha magulu, na mweye wenyego kwa mwenyego molondeka kuisunha magulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kwa vija niye niweng'heni mfano uno, na mweye ivija muisang'hanile kama viniwasang'hanile. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nowalongela, mtumigwa si mkulu kubita Mkulu wake, hebu mtumigwa si mkulu kubita ija yamtumile. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Basi yahawa mogamanya gago, mmweda mhagasang'hanila. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Gano ganilonga si kwa mbuli ya mweye wose. Niye niwamanya waja iniwasagule. Mbali mayandiko ga Mulungu golondeka gavikile kama vigalonga, ‘Ija yadile ndiya yangu, kahinduka na kunitoa.’<verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Niwalongela mbuli zino sambi zing'hali kulawilila, zaheza kulawilila mpate kutogola, ‘Niye iyo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nowalongeleni kweli. Yoombokela munhu ija nimtumile konibokela niye, na iyo yonibokela niye kombokela iyo yanhumile.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela kokwiza kuhindukigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, Yesu kengiligwa fufunhende ng'hani muumoyo wake kalonga, “Nowalongeleni kweli, imwe mmwenu kokwiza kunihinduka!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Baho waluko wake wailola wenyego kuno wapotigwa kuvimanya yalihi yolongeligwa mbuli zino.<verse eid="JHN 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mwaluko imwe ija Yesu yeli na wende nayo ng'hani, kakala habehi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Basi Simoni Petulo kamwing'ha chilaguso Mndewa yamuuze, “Kolonga kwa mbuli ya nani.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Mwaluko ija kuno kamsigamila Yesu na kamuuza, “Mndewa chilongele yelihi yonda yakuhinduke?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu kalonga, “Munhu ija yonda nimwing'he chihande cha mgate chinizanhika mumsuzi, iyo mwenyego.” Baho, kakisola chija chihande cha mgate kakizanhika mumsuzi, kamwing'ha Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikaliote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda viyakomeleze kubokela chihande icho cha mgate, amala Mwenembago kamwingila. Yesu kamlongela Yuda, “Chuulonda kuchisang'hana, lopola kusang'hana!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Mbali habule munhu hata imwe mmwao mwa waja wakalile mmeza yamanyile habali Yuda kalongeligwa ivo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwa vija Yuda kakala mgoga kadi ya sente, wanhu wamwenga watonga kua Yesu kakala yamlongele yakagule vinhu va lusona, hebu kakala yamlongele kalave chochose kwa vikumbi muyega.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Baho Yuda viyamalile kubokela chija chihande cha mgate, bahaja kalawa kunze. Na ikala ichilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagizi ya Sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda viyasegele, Yesu kalonga, “Sambi Mwana wa Munhu katogoligwa, na Mulungu katogoligwa mgati yake. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Yahawa ukulu wa Mulungu ugubuligwa mgati ya Mwana, basi na Mulungu nayo koulagusa ukulu wa Mwana mgati yake mwenyego, na bahaja kotenda ivo.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Wanangu, niye ning'hali na mweye chipindi chiguhi tu. Monizambwila, mbali sambi nowalongeleni gaja niwalongele vilongozi wa Wayahudi, ‘Kuniita niye mweye hamdaha kuita!’<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Noweng'ha ndagizi ya sambi, muing'he wende, ing'haneni wende wenyego kwa wenyego, kama vinili na wende na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Kama mweye muhaing'ha wende, wanhu wose wovimanya kua mweye mwawaluko wangu.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagusa kua Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petulo kamuuza Yesu, Mndewa koita kulihi? Yesu kamwidika, “Kuniita sambi hudaha kuniwinza, mbali kodaha kuniwinza chipindi icho wokwiza.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo kamuuza Mndewa, “Habali sidaha kukuwinza sambi? Nhogola kudanganika kwa mbuli yako!” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ivo, Kutogola kweli kudanganika kwa mbuli yangu? Nokulongela kweli, yang'hali nzogolo hanakwika, gweye konibela mala nhatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo nzila ya kuita kwa Tata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu kawalongela, seke mgwe fufunhende mmoyo. “Mtogoleni Mulungu na mhogole na niye ivija.<verse eid="JHN 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Muikae ya Tati yangu hana nyafasi ng'hulu ya kukala, maza haiwile ivo nihawalongeleni. Sambi noita kuwatandileni goya nyafasi. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na nihaita kuwatandileni hanhu hakukala, nobwela kuwagala kumwangu, ili hanili niye na mweye mkale. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na mweye movimanya vija va kuita kuja kuniita.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi kamlongela, “Mndewa cheye hachimanyile kuuita, chodahaze kuimanya nzila iyo?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu kamwidika, “Niye iyo nzila, nowalongela wanhu ukweli wa Mulungu na kuweng'ha ugima ulibule uhelelo, munhu heza kwa Tata bila kubitila niye. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Mwahanimanya niye, mommanya na Tata ivija, kulawa sambi mommanya, na kaidi mmona.<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo kamlongela, “Mndewa, chilagusile Tata, yotosha.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu kamlongela Filipo, “Nikala na mweye mazua gano gose, na gweye Filipo ung'hali hunimanya niye? Yanionile niye kamona Tata. Ivo kodahaze, kunongela, ‘Chilagusile Tata?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Ivo, gweye hutogola kama niye namgati ya Tata, nayo Tata kamgati yangu? Mbuli ziniwalongeleni, sizilonga kwa udahi wangu, mbali Tata yeli mgati mwangu iyo yosang'hana sang'hano zake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Molondeka kunhogola kua niye namgati ya Tata na Tata kamgati yangu. Kama hamnitogola, nhogoleni kwa sang'hano zinisang'hana. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Nowalongeleni kweli, munhu yonitogola niye, nayo kosang'hana mbuli zose zinisang'hana, enaa, kozisang'hana sang'hano ng'hulu ng'hani kwa vija niye noita kwa Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na mwahapula jojose kama vinilonda nodisang'hana, ili Tata yatogoligwe mgati ya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ivija mwahanipula jojose kama vinilonda nomsang'hanileni.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolalika kumgala Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Kama mwahawa na wende na niye, mozitegeleza ndagizi zangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Na niye nowapulila kwa Tati yangu yaweng'he Mtazi imwenga yakale na mweye mazua gose galibule uhelelo. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Iyo ni Muhe wa kweli, wanhu wa isi hawadaha kumbokela kwa vija wanhu hawadaha kumuona hebu kummanya. Mbali mweye mommanya kwa vija kokala na mweye na kamgati yenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Niye siwaleka wachiwa, ivo nobwela kaidi kukala na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ching'hali mazua madodo, wanhu wa muuisi hawaniona niye kaidi, mbali mweye moniona, kwa vija niye namgima na mweye mokua na ugima. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Zua ijo dihavika, movimanya kua niye na mgati ya Tata na mweye mokua mgati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Waja wozibokela ndagizi zangu na kuzigoga, wao weli na wende na niye. Nayeli na wende na niye kokwing'higwa wende na Tata yangu, na niye nomwing'ha wende na kuilagusa kumwake. <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda mbali si ija Isikaliote kamlongela, “Mndewa yodahikaze gweye konda kuilagusa kumwetu na sio kwa wanhu wa isi?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu kalonga, “Waja waning'ha wende nie, wosang'hana gaja ganiwalongela, nayo Tata yangu komwing'ha wende, nie na Tataangu chokwiza kumwao na kukala nao. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Munhu yelibule wende na niye hasang'hana kama vinilonda, na usenga umuhulike si wangu, mbali ulawa kumwake Tata ija yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Niwafunda mbuli zino ng'hali na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mbali Mtazi ni Muhe wa Mulungu, iyo Tata kamtuma kwa zina jangu, kowafunda chila chinhu na kuwakumbusa gose ganiwalongeleni. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nowalekeleni utindiwala, enaa, noweng'heni utindiwala wangu. Siweng'heni mweye kama vija wanhu wa isi viwoweng'ha. Sekemdumbe hebu sekemgwae. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mkala mnihulike vinilongile, ‘Nosegela amala nobwela kaidi kumwenu. Kama mwahawile na wende na niye, mwahawile na deng'ho kwa vija noita kwa Tata, manake iyo iyo Mkulu kubita niye. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Niwalongeleni gano sambi, gang'hali haganalawilila, ili gaheza kulawilila mwize kutogola. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Niye silonga ng'hani na mweye mbuli zino, kwa vija mkulu wa isi ino kokwiza. Iyo kumwangu niye hadaha chinhu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />mbali wanhu wa isi wolondeka kuvimanya kua niye ninawende na Tata, iyo mana nosang'hana chila chinhu kama vija Tata viyanilagize. “Haya imeni chisegeleni hano!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo mzabibu wa kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Amala Yesu kalonga, “Niye iyo mzabibu wa kweli, na Tati yangu iyo mlimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Chila kwamvi mmwangu dilekile kulela kodisegeza, na chila kwamvi dilela kodidahulila dilele ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mweye mmala kunang'hana mmoyo kwavija msunhigwa kwa uja usenga uniwalongeleni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Kaleni mgati yangu kama vinikala mgati yenu. Kama vija kwamvi da mzabibu hadidaha kulela manhunda diiyeka kama hadikalile mdisina, ivija namweye hamdaha kusang'hana vija viyalonda Mulungu kama hamkala mgati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Niye uwo mzabibu na mweye iyo makwamvi. Waja wokala mgati yangu, na niye mgati yao, wao wosang'hana mbuli nyingi ziyalonda Mulungu, manake bila niye mweye hamdaha kusang'hana chochose.<verse eid="JHN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Munhu yoyose kama hakalile mgati yangu, kokwasigwa kunze kama kwamvi vijasigwa kunze mbaka donyala. Wanhu hudidondola kwamvi kama ijo na kujasa mmoto dilungule.<verse eid="JHN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mweye mwahakala mgati yangu, na usenga wangu uhakala mgati yenu, puleni jojose dimlonda na mweye mokwing'higwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Baho Tati yangu kotogoligwa kama muhasang'hana mbuli nyingi ziyalonda Mungu na mweye mokua waluko wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Niye nina wende na mweye kama vija Tata viyeli na wende na niye. Kaleni muuwende wangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mwahazitegeleza ndagizi zangu, mokala muuwende wangu, kama na niye vinitegeleza ndagizi za Tati yangu na kukala muuwende wake. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Niye niwalongeleni mbuli zino ili deng'helelo jangu dikale mgati yenu, na deng'ho jenu jenele. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ino iyo ndagizi yangu, mkale na wende, amala mkale na wende kama vinikalile na wende na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Habule wende mkulu kubita wende wa munhu yolava ugima wake kwa mbuli ya mbwiga zake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mweye mokua mbwiga zangu mwahazitenda ziniwalagiza. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Niye siwakema kaidi watumigwa, kwa vija watumigwa hawavimanya choyosang'hana mkulu wao, mbali niwakema mweye mbwiga zangu, kwa vija nikala niwagubulila mbuli zose zinihulike kulawa kwa Tati yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mweye hamnisagule niye, mbali niye niwasagule mweye na kuwalagiza mukasang'hane gaja goyolonda Mulungu, naizo sang'hano zokala mazua gose, ili jojose monda mumpule Tata kama vija vinilonda, yaweng'he. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Na ndagizi yangu iyo ino muwe na wende wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa isi owehila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Kama wanhu wa isi ino wahawehila mweye, mvimanye kua mng'hali kuhiligwa mweye wanihila niye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Kama mwahawile wanhu wa isi ino, wanhu wa isi wahaweng'heni wende kama wanhu wao. Kwa vija mweye sio wanhu wa isi ino, mbali niye niwasagula kulawa muuisi ino, ino iyo mbuli ya wanhu wa isi kuwehila.<verse eid="JHN 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Sekemuisemwe mbuli viniwalongeleni, mtumigwa si mkulu kubita mkulu wake. Yahawa wanidununza niye, wowadununza na mweye ivija, kama wategeleza mbuli zangu, wotegeleza na mbuli zenu ivija.<verse eid="JHN 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Mbali wowasang'hanila gago gose kwavija mweye wajalusona wangu, manake hawamanyile iyo yanhumile. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Mbali kama sizile na kuwalongela usenga wa Mulungu, wahalekile kua na malozo, mbali sambi hawadaha kuigombela kua wabule malozo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Munhu yoyose yonihila niye iyo komwihila na Tati yangu ivija. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Maza sizisang'hane mbuli zija hagati yao gaja habule munhu imwenga yagasang'hane wahalekile kua na gehile, mbali sambi wagaona nie vinigasang'hane gago wanihila niye na wamwihila na Tata yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Iyo mana gaja gandikigwe mzindagizi zao ni kweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 15:25">‘Wanihila bule!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Yaheza iyo Mtazaji inilonda nimtume kumwenu kulawa kwa Tata, iyo Muhe wa kweli, yolawa kwa Tata, iyo kowalongela kweli yose kwambuli yangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na mweye ivija mowalongela wamwenga mbuli zangu kwa vija mukala na niye kulawa haumwanduso.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Niye niwalongeleni gago ili mgangamale sekemuileke nhogola yenu.<verse eid="JHN 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Wanhu wowawinga mweye mui Ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kufugama, kaidi chipindi chokwiza chila yomkomeni mweye kotonga kua komsang'hanila Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Nao wowatendela gago kwa vija hawammanyile Tata hebu niye.<verse eid="JHN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Baho niwalongela mweye mbuli zino, ili saa yake ihavika, sekemuisemwe kua niwalongeleni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Sang'hano za Muhe wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Niwalongeleni mbuli zino kulawa haumwanduso kwa vija nikala hamwe na mweye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Mbali sambi noita kwa iyo yanhumile, na habule hata munhu yaniuzile, kuniita kulihi? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwa vija viniwalongele mbuli zino mmema giogio mmoyo. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Hata ivo niye nowalongeleni kweli, yofaya ng'hani kumwenu niye nisegele, manake kama nahaleka kuita mtazaji hokwiza kumwenu, mbali nihaiita baho nomtuma kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Nayo vonda yeze kowagangamizila wanhu wa isi kua wabananga kwa mbuli ya malozo, utogoligwa na ulamuzi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Wabananga mbuli ya malozo, kwa vija niye hawanitogola, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />muhe wa Mulungu kowagangamizila kwa mbuli ya kutogoligwa kwangu ha Mulungu, kwa vija noita kwa Tata na mweye hamniona kaidi,<verse eid="JHN 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />na mbuli ya ulamuzi, kwa vija ija Mwenembago iyo Mkulu wa isi ino kamala kulamuligwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ning'hali na mbuli nyingi za kuwalongeleni, mbali sambi hamdaha kufunya moyo.<verse eid="JHN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Mbali vonda yeze iyo Muhe wa kweli kowalongoza muikweli yose, manake halonga chinhu kwa udahi wake mwenyego, mbali kogalonga gaja yagahulike kulawa kumwangu na kowalongeleni gaja gonda kwiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Iyo koning'ha nhogolwa niye kwa vija komulongeni gaja gonda kupata kulawa kumwangu.<verse eid="JHN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vose viyali navo Tata ni vangu, iyo mana nilonga kua uwo Muhe wa Mulungu komulongeleni gaja gose gonda kupata kulawa kumwangu.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kua na giogio na kua na deng'helelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ching'hali chipindi chidodo hamniona, na chahabita chitambo chidodo kaidi moniona. <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Baho waluko wake wamwenga waiuza, “Manake choni viyachilongela, ‘ching'hali chipindi chidodo moniona na chahabita chipindi chidodo kaidi moniona?’ Kaidi kolonga, ‘kwa vija noita kwa Tata!’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Waja waluko wagendelela kuiuza, “Manake choni viyalonga, ‘Ching'hali chipindi chidodo?’ Hachivimanya kulonga choni.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Baho Yesu kavimanya kua wonda wamuuze, baho kawalongela, “Ivo moiuza kwa mbuli ya gaja ganilongile, ‘Ching'hali chipindi chidodo hamniona, na chahabita chipindi chidodo kaidi moniona?’<verse eid="JHN 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nowalongeleni kweli, mweye molila na kulombokeza, mbali wanhu wa isi wodeng'helela, mweye mogwa giogio, mbali giogio jenu dohinduka kua ndeng'helelo.<verse eid="JHN 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mwanachike yahaibasula kogwa giogio kwa vija saa ya usungu ivika, mbali yahaibasula hakumbuka kaidi usungu uwo kwa mbuli ya ndeng'helelo ya kua munhu kavumbuka muiisi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Mweye ivija mna giogio sambi, mbali nombweleleni kaidi, na mweye momema ndeng'helelo mmoyo, na ndeng'helelo iyo habule munhu yonda yailave kumwenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Mdizua ijo hamnipula chochose. Nomlongeleni kweli chochose chumumpula Tata komwing'heni kama vinilonda. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbaka sambi hamnampula chochose kwa udaho wangu. Puleni, na mweye mokwing'higwa ili ndeng'helelo yenu yenele.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kauhuma ludabwa lwa ubananzi Muiisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Niye niwalongela mbuli zino mchifiso. Mbali chipindi chokwiza silonga na mweye kaidi mchifiso, mbali nowalongeleni bila chifiso kwa mbuli ya Tata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mdizua ijo mopula kwavija vumnitogola, na siwalongeleni kua nokwiza kumpula Tata kwa mbuli yenu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwa vija iyo Tata mwenyego kana wende na mweye kwa vija mweye mna wende na niye na mtogola kua ndawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nilawa kwa Tata kwiza muuisi, na sambi noileka Isi nobwela kwa Tata.<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Amala Waluko wake walongela,”Onaa, sambi kolonga hazelu kabisa bila kuchifisa.<verse eid="JHN 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Sambi chovimanya kua gweye kochimanya chila chinhu na hulonda kuuzigwa mbuli na munhu yoyose, kwaivo chitogola kua kolawa kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu kawedika, Ivo, motogola sambi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Saa yokwiza, na kaidi ivika baho na mweye mose mopwililika chila munhu kobwela kumwake, na niye nolekigwa niliye. Mbali niye siliniiyeka, manake na hamwe na Tata.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Niwalongeleni mbuli zino ili mkale kwa utindiwala kwa mbuli kuilumba na niye. Muuisi ino mweye mogaya, mbali gangamaleni, kwa vija niye niuhuma ludabwa lwa ubananzi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapulila Waluko wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, kalola kuulanga kwa Mulungu kawapulila na kulonga, “Tata, ija saa ivika! Mwing'he Mwanago nhogolwa, nayo Mwanago yakwing'he nhogolwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Manake kumwing'ha Mwanago udahi mwa wanhu wose ili yaweng'he ugima ulibule uhelelo waja wose umwing'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ugima ulibule uhelelo uwo uno, wakumanye gweye waiyeka Mulungu wa kweli na kumanya Yesu Kilisito umtumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Niye nikutogola hano muiisi, nikomeleza ija sang'hano yuning'hile niisang'hane. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Na vino sambi, Tata, nhogole hamwako kwa kulagusa ukulu uja ung'halile nao ing'hali isi hainalumbigwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nikutenda umanyike kwa wanhu waja uning'hile kulawa muuisi. Wakala wanhu wako, na gweye kuning'ha wawe wangu, nao wautegeleza usenga wako.<verse eid="JHN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Sambi wavimanya kua chila chiuning'hile chilawa kumwako.<verse eid="JHN 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Niye niwafunda gaja gauning'hile, nao waubokela na wavimanya kweli nilawa kumwako, na watogola kua gweye iyo unhumile.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nowapulila wao, hebu siwapulila wanhu wa isi, mbali nowapulila waja uning'hile, manake ni wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Waja wanilinao ni wako, na wako ni wangu, na ukulu wangu wooneka mgati yao wao uning'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Sambi nie nokwiza kumwako, nosegela muuisi ino, mbali wao wamuuisi. Tata uliyeka! Nokupula wamile wakale kama vuuli, kaidi wakale hamwe kama cheye vichili hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Vinikalile nao, niye niwakimila goya kama vuulondile. Kaidi niye niwakimila, hebu nabule hata imwe mmwao yagile, mbali kwa ija mwana yagile, ili Mayandiko ga Mulungu gavikile. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Ivo sambi nokwiza kumwako, nilonga mbuli zino muuisi, ili wadahe kuilumba vinogile muindeng'helelo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Niye niweng'ha usenga wako, nao wanhu wa isi wawehila kwa vija wao sio wa isi, kama vija niye vinili sio wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Niye sipula uwalave muuisi, mbali nokupula uwakimile kulawa kwa ija Mbananzi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Wao sio wa isi ino, kama nie ivija vinili sio wa isi ino. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Wasimike muukweli, na usenga wako iyo ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kama vija vuunhumile muuisi, na niye ivija niwatuma wao muuisi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Na kwa mbuli yao niye mwenyego noilava ubanzi wako ili wao wamwede, nawao walavigwe wawe wako kubitila kweli.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Niwapulila wao waiyeka, mbali nowapulila na waja wose wonda wanitogole kubitila usenga wao. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nopula ili wose wawe chinhu chimwe. Tata! Nopula wawe mgati yetu, kama vija gweye vuuli mgati yangu na niye mgati yako. Nopula wawe chinhu chimwe ili wanhu wa isi watogole kua gweye iyo unhumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Niye niweng'ha nhogolwa yuuning'hile niye niweng'ha wao ili wawe chinhu chimwe kama cheye vichili wamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Niye nikale mgati yao, na gweye ukale mgati yangu, nopula ili uwagangamize wawe chinhu chimwe, ili wanhu wa isi wavimanye kua gweye iyo unhumile, na kaidi gweye kuna wende nao kama vuuli na wende na niye.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tata! Nolonda, wao uning'hile wawe hamwe na niye haja hanili, ili wawone uja ukulu wangu uning'hile, kwa vija kukala na wende na niye isi ing'hali hainalumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Go Tata mtendagoya mazua gose! wanhu wa isi hawakumanyile, mbali niye nokumanya. Wano nao wovimanya kua gweye iyo unhumile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nikutenda umanyike nao na nogendelela kusang'hana ivo wakumanye, ili wende ulinao kumwangu ukale mgati yao, na niye nikale mgati yao.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kaita umwambu mwa kizanda cha Kediloni, hamwe na waluko wake. Hanhu haja hakala na konde, nayo Yesu na waluko wake wengila umo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, ija yamuhinduke Yesu, kahamanya hanu haja kwa vija Yesu kazoela kuiting'hanila na waluko wake haja.<verse eid="JHN 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Baho Yuda kasola maasikali na wamilizi kulawa kwa wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na Mafalisayo, keza nao kudikonde weli na lumuli na viwenge na migoha. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu kuno yovimanya gonda gamlawilile, kawauza, “Momzambwila nani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nao wedika, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” Yesu kawalongela, “Iyo niye.” Yuda yamuhinduke kakala kema baho hamwe nao. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Basi Yesu viyawalongele “Iyo niye,” wabwela kukisogo wagwa hasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Baho Yesu kawauza kaidi, “Momzambwila nani?” Nao wamwidika, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu kwawalongela, “Niye nimala kuwalongela iyo niye. Ivo, kama monizambwila niye, walekeni wano wasegele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesu kalonga gago ili gadahe kuvikila gaja gayalongile, “Tata waja uning'hile simwagize hata imwe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Basi Simoni ija Yesu yamkemile Petulo kakala na panga, kasomola panga na kamkanha gutwi da ubanzi wa kulume mtumigwa wa Mkulu wa nhambiko. Na mtumigwa iyo kakemigwa Maluko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Basi Yesu kamlongela Petulo, “Bweleza panga jako mumvuko wake. Ivo! hailondeka nibitile madununzo gaja Tati yangu kagalonda nigabitile?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa mkulu wa Walava nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Amala ma asikali waja na mkulu wao na wamilizi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu wamgoga Yesu na wamgela nzabi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />mosi wamgala kwa Anasi, nayo Anasi kakala tata mkoi wa Kayafa, ija yakalile mkulu wa Walava nhambiko mlao uja. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Na iyo Kayafa iyo yawalongele Wayahudi kua, yolondeka munhu imwe yafe kwa mbuli ya wanhu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69">Matayo 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo na mwaluko imwenga wamuwinza Yesu. Na iyo mwaluko imwenga kakala komanyika na mkulu wa Walava nhambiko, ivo kengila hamwe na Yesu haichiambaza cha mkulu wa Walava nhambiko,<verse eid="JHN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />mbali Petulo kema kunze, behi na lwivi. Ivo ija mwaluko imwenga yamanyike na mkulu wa Walava nhambiko kalawa kunze na kulongela ija mtumwa wa chike mkaliza lwivi, nayo kamwingiza Petulo mng'anda. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Iyo mtumwa wa chike mkaliza lwivi kamuuza Petulo, “Ivo, na gweye ivija si imwe mwa waluko wa munhu iyo?” Petulo kedika, “Hambee, sio ni e.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Watumigwa na wamilizi wakala wabwinha moto kwa vija hakala na mbeho, wakala wokotela moto. Nayo Petulo kakala kema hamwe nao kuno kokotela moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu wa Walava nhambiko komuuza na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Gago vigakalile gogendelela, mkulu wa Walava nhambiko kakala komuuza mbuli ya Yesu na mafundo gake nawaja waluko wake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu kamwidika, “Niye nilonga na chila munhu mazua gose bila kifiso. Mala zose nikala nofunda Mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kufugama, ivija Muing'anda ya Mulungu, haja hawaiting'hanila Wayahudi wose, na nilonga chila chinhu hazelu. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Habali koniuza niye? Wauze wanhu wanihulike chinhu gani chiniwalongele, wao wochimanya chiniwalongele.<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesu viyamalile kulonga gago, mmilizi imwe yakalile kema baho, kamtoa Yesu ng'hua yolonga, “Gweye ivo umwidika mkulu wa Walava nhambiko?<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Baho Yesu kamwidika, kama nilonga vihile, lagusa chinibanange, mbali kama nilonga goya, konhoela choni? <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ivo Anasi kamgala Yesu kuno yafungigwe nzabi kwa Kayafa mkulu wa Walava nhambiko.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kambela Yesu kaidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Baho Petulo kakala baho kokotela moto. Ivo wamuuza, “Na gweye ivija si imwe mwamwaluko wake?” Petulo kabela na kulonga, “Habule, nie sio.” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Baho, imwe wa waja watumigwa wa mkulu wa Walava nhambiko yakalile mbwiga wa ija munhu yakan'higwe gutwi na Petulo, “Kauza, ivo niye sikuonile mdikonde vuukalile hamwe nayo?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petulo kabela kaidi, bahaja nzogolo keka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matayo 27:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ivo vilongozi wa Wayahudi wamsola Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa wamgala mbaka muing'anda ya Kifaume. Iyo ikala imitondo lukwili, nao ili wadahe kuja lusona lwa Pasaka, hawengile mng'anda ya ufaume ili sekewalemigwe kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Baho Pilato kawawinza kunze na kawalongela, “Munhu ino momlongeleza kwa mbuli gani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Wamwidika, “Mbali kama munhu ino hawile mbananzi chihalekile kumgala kumwako.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Baho, Pilato kawalongela, “Msoleni mweye wenyego mkamlamule kwa kuilinga na ndagizi yenu.” Wayahudi wamwidika, “Cheye chabule udaho wa kumkoma munhu yoyose.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Isang'hanika ivo ili mbuli ziyalongile Yesu kulagusa kodanganika ifa gani.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Baho Pilato kengila kaidi muing'anda ya ufaume, kalagiza wamgale Yesu kumwake na kamuuza, “Ivo eti gweye iyo mfaume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ivo, uno ulonzi wako mwenyego hebu wamwenga wakulongela mbuli zangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato nayo kamwidika, “Ivo niye ni Myahudi? Wanhu wa isi yako na Walava nhambiko wakugala kumwangu. Kubananga choni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu kamwidika,“Ufaume wangu sio wa isi ino. Kama ufaume wangu uhawile wa isi ino, wajalusona wangu wahanigombele seke nigogigwe na Wayahudi. Mbali sambi ufaume wangu sio wa hano!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Amala Pilato kamlongela Yesu, “Ivo gweye ni Mfaume?” Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye kulonga kua niye na Mfaume. Niye nileliligwa kwa mbuli iyo, na kwa mbuli iyo niza muiisi kuwalongela wanhu kwa mbuli ya kweli. Chila munhu yowinza ukweli konitegeleza.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato kamlongela,“Ukweli ni chinhu gani?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu kolamuligwa ifa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Baho Pilato viyamalile kulonga gago kawawinza kaidi Wayahudi kunze, kawalongela, “Niye sikiona chochose kumwake chiyabanange. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Mbali mna mazoela ga niye kuwalekesela mfungigwa imwe mchipindi cha Pasaka. Ivo molonda niwalekesele Mfaume wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Baho watoa nyangi, “Habule! sio ino, ila Balaba!” Nayo Balaba kakala mbavi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ivo Pilato kaweng'ha Yesu, na kalagiza yatoigwe mbalati. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nao asikali wazinga kigalama cha miwa wamwika mditwi, na wamvaza valo da kifaume da langi ya zambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Wakala wokwela kaidi na kaidi haja hayeli muing'anda ya kifaume wamlamsa, “Mwinyi mfaume wa Wayahudi!” Kuno womtoa kwa mang'hua.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato kalawa kunze kaidi, na kawalongela, “Loleni nomlava kunze kumwenu, mdahe kuvimanya kua niye sionile chochose chihile chiyabanange.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Baho Yesu kalawa kunze kuno kavala kigalama cha miwa na kanzu da langi ya zambalau. Pilato kawalongela, “Loleni! Munhu wenu ino hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Basi waja wakulu wa Walava nhambiko na wamilizi wao viwamonile Yesu, watoa nyangi walonga, “Yawambigwe! Yawambigwe!” Baho Pilato kawalongela, “Msoleni mweye wenyego mkamuwambe mumsalaba, kwa vija niye sionile chochose chihile chiyasang'hane.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi wamwidika, “Cheye chinayo ndagizi za Musa na kuilinga na ndagizi iyo, ino kolondeka yafe, kwa vija kaitenda kua Mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato viyahulike mbuli iyo kadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Basi, Pilato kamsola Yesu na kengila nayo mng'anda, na kamuuza Yesu, gweye kulawa kulihi?” Mbali Yesu hedike mbuli yoyose. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Baho Pilato kamlongela, “Hulonga na niye? Ivo, huvimanyile kua ninao udaho wa kukulekesa na udaho wa kukuwamba muumsalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu kedika kamlongela,“Uhawilebule udaho kumwangu kama hwing'higwe na Mulungu. Kwa mbuli iyo, ija yanigalile kumwako kana malozo ng'hani.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kulawa baho, Pilato kazambwila nzila ya kumlekesa, mbali Wayahudi watoa nyangi, “Wahamlekesa munhu ino gweye sio mbwigaake Kaisali, chila munhu yoitenda kua mfaume komlema Kaisali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Baho, Pilato viyehulike mbuli iyo, kamlava Yesu kunze, na kakala mchigoda cha ulamuzi, hanhu hokemigwa, “Lubuga wa dibwe.” kwa chiebulania hokemigwa “Gabbata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Nayo dikala zua da kutanda lusona lwa Pasaka, yopata saa sita imisi. Pilato kawalongela Wayahudi, “Mfaume wenu ino hano!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Wao wenula dizi, “Msegeze! Msegeze! Umuwambe! Pilato kawauza, ivo! mwonda nimuwambe mfaume wenu!” wakulu wa Walava nhambiko walonga, “Cheye chabule mfaume ila Kaisali.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Baho Pilato kaweng'ha Yesu ili wamuwambe mumsalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Baho, wamsola Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu kaita kuno kaupapa msalaba wake kaita hanu, hokemigwa “Vuha da ditwi” kwa chiebulania hokemigwa Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Wamuwamba uko mumsalaba, hamwe na waja wamwenga waidi, imwe mumsalaba wa ubanzi wa kumoso na imwenga mumsalaba wa ubanzi wa kulume na Yesu kakala hagati yao. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Baho Pilato kandika yandiko mchibao keka muumsalaba. Najo dikala jandikigwa vino, “Yesu Mnazaleti, Mfaume wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Wanhu wengi wadisoma yandiko dija, kwa vija haja yawambigwe Yesu hakala habehi na kae. Kaidi yandiko ijo, jandikigwa kwa Chiebulania na Chilatini na Chigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Ivo, wakulu wa Walava nhambiko wamlongela wamlongela Pilato, “Sekewandike, ‘Mfaume wa Wayahudi, ila ‘Iyo kalonga, Niye ni Mfaume wa Wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato kamwidika, “Ganyandike nyandika.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Nao asikali viwakomelez e kumuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, wasola vivalo vake, wavigola mafungu mane, chila asikali vungu dimwe, ivija wasola na kanzu yake, kanzu iyo ikala ifumigwe na chihande chimwe bila kusonigwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Baho, asikali waja waitogolela wenyego, “Sekechiidege, ila chiitowele simbi yokuwa ya nani.” Mbuli ino isang'hanigwa ili gavikile Mayandiko ga Mulungu golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Waigolela vivalo vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na kanzu yangu waitowela simbi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Baho ivo viwasang'hane wao asikali.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Habehi na msalaba wake Yesu, wakala wemile mami yake na mkulu wa mami yake yani Malia muke wa Kiliopa, na Malia wa Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Basi Yesu viyamonile mami yake na behi nayo kema ija mwaluko yeli na wende nayo, “Kamlongela mami yake, “Mama! Mlole mwanago ino hano.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Amala Yesu kamlongela ija mwaluko, “Mlole mami yako ino hano.” Kulawila baho iyo mwaluko kamsola mami yake na kukala nayo ukae yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Amala Yesu viyamanyile kua gose gakala gavikila, na ili Mayandiko gavikile, kalonga, “Noona ng'hilu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Baho hakala na bakuli dimema siki, baho wachova sifongo muisiki, na kuigela mulumango lwa hi sopo, wamwikila Yesu mumlomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Basi Yesu viyaibokele ija siki, kalonga, “Gamala!” Amala kainamila kadanganika.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikali komhoma Yesu mgoha mulubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ivo kwavija ikala zua da kuitanda na Zua da kuhumula na kufugama ya Wayahudi, kwavija mitufi sekeikale mumsalaba Zua da kuhumula, manake Zua ijo da kuhumula digwila mchipindi cha zua da Pasaka, Wayahudi wampula Pilato migulu ya wao wawambigwe ibenigwe na mitufi yao isegezigwe mmisalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Baho, asikali waita, waibena migulu ya munhu wa mosi na ija wakaidi waja wawambigwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Mbali viwamvikile ha Yesu wamwona kamala kudanganika, kwaivo hawambenile magulu. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Mbali asikali imwe kamhoma na mgoha Yesu mulubavu, na baho damu na mazi vilawa. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ija yaionile mbuli iyo kailonga mbuli iyo ili na mweye mdahe kutogola. Gago gayalongile ni kweli, kaidi iyo kovimanya kua kolonga ukweli. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mbuli iyo ilawila ili Mayandiko gavikile, “Habule hata mvuha wake umwe wonda ubenigwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kaidi Mayandiko gamwenga golonga, “Womlola ija iwamuhomile.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowandigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Baho, Yusufu mwenekae wa Alimataya kampula Pilato ausole lukuli lwa Yesu. Yusufu kakala mwaluko wa Yesu mbali kwa chifiso, manake kakala yowadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Baho, Pilato kamtogolela. Ivo Yusufu kaita kausola lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nayo Nikodemo yaitile kwa Yesu ichilo, keza kuno kasola vinhu kama vija manemane na ubani kama kilo salasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Basi, wausola lukuli lwa Yesu na kuuzinga sitili ya kitani inogile hamwe na vija vinhung'hila kama vigawile mazoela ga Wayahudi viwowanda. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Haja hanhu hawamuwambile hakala na konde, na mdikonde ijo hakala na panga da sambi dikala ding'hali hadina wandiligwa munhu.<verse eid="JHN 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Baho, kwa vija wakala woitanda na zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi,na kwa vija panga ijo dikala habehi, baho wamwika Yesu umo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Panga dilibule chinhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ikala imitondo zua da mosi da juma, kung'hali ziza, Malia kulawa Magidala kaita kudipanga na kadivika dija dibwe disegezigwa hakwingilila mdipanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Baho kalopola kukimbila kuita kwa Simoni Petulo na ija mwaluko imwenga yeli na wende nayo, kawalongela, “Wamlava Mndewa mdipanga na hachivimanyile hanhu hawawikile mtufi wake.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Baho Petulo na ija mwaluko imwenga waita mbaka kuja kudipanga. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Wose waidi wakala wokimbila, mbali ija mwaluko imwenga kakala kokimbila ng'hani kubita Petulo, na kalongola kuvika kudipanga.<verse eid="JHN 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Viyainamile na kasungulila mgati, kaona sitili tu ziiyanzanza, mbali hengile mgati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petulo nayo keza yomuwinza kengila mdipanga umo kaona sitili tu ziiyanzanza, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na chija chitambala chiyafungigwe Yesu mditwi. Icho chitambala hachikigwe hamwe na iyo sitili, mbali chikala chiivunyanga na kukala chiiyeka hamgwazo.<verse eid="JHN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Amala ija mwaluko yalongole kuvika kudipanga nayo kengila mgati, kalola na katogola. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Wakala wang'hali hawanavimanya mayandiko ga Mulungu vigalongile kua ikala yolondeka Yesu yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ivo, wao waluko wabwela ukae.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Malia wa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matayo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9">Maluko 16:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Malia wa Magidalakakala kema hanze ya panga, yolila. Kuno yang'hali yolila kainama na kusungulila mdipanga <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />kawaona watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu waidi, wavalile vivalo vizelu, wakala haja hautambalazigwe lukuli lwa Yesu, imwe mditwi na wa kaidi hamagulu.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Nao watumigwa wa kwa Mulungu wamuuza Malia, “Mama choni chuulilila?” Nayo kawalongela, “Wausegeza mtufi wa Mndewa wangu, na simanyile kuwamwikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kahinduka hachisogo kamuona Yesu kema, mbali hammanyile kua iyo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu kamuuza, “Mama, kolilila choni? Komzambwila nani?” Malia katonga kua iyo ni mwamizi wa konde, kamlongela, “Go mkulu, kama gweye umsegeze, basi nilongele kuuwikile na niye nikausole.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu kamlongela, “Maliam!” Nayo Malia kamhindukila Yesu na kamlongela kwa chiebulania, “Labboni!” Manake “Mfundaji.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu kamlongela, “Seke unyamhe, ning'hali sinaita kwa Tata. Mbali genda kwa walukolo wangu ukawalongele, noita uchanha kwa Tati yangu na Tati yenu, na Mulungu wangu na Mulungu wenu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Baho Maliam kulawa Magidala kaita kwa waluko wa Yesu na kawalongela, “Nimuona Mndewa,” na kua Yesu kakala yamlongele ivo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila waluko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ikala ichigulogulo ya zua da mosi da juma. Waluko wakala waiting'hanila hamwe mng'anda, na milwivi ikala zihindigwe kwa vija wawadumba vilongozi wa Wayahudi. Baho Yesu keza kema hagati yao kawalongela,“Utindiwala ukale na mweye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Viyakomeleze kulonga gago, kawalagusila makono gage na lubavu lwake. Waja waluko wake wadeng'helela ng'hani viwamonile Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu kawalongela kaidi,“Utindiwala ikale na mweye! Kama vija Tata viyanhumile niye, na niye nowatumani mweye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nayo viyakomeleze kugalonga gago, kawahuvilila mhuzi na kuwalongela, “Bokeleni Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mwahawalekesela wanhu malozo gao, walekesiligwa, kama hamuwalekesele wanhu ubananzi wao, wosigala na malozo gao.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi, imwe mwa waja kumi na waidi yokemigwa pacha, hakalile hamwe nao haja Yesu viyawalawile. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Baho waja waluko wamwenga wamlongela, “Chimuona Mndewa.” Mbali nayo kawalongela, “Kama sina ziona zija ng'hovu za misumali mmakono gake na kugela chidole changu mzing'hovu izo za misumali na makono gangu muulubavu wake sitogola ng'o.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Vigabitile mazua manane, waluko wakala hamwe kaidi mja mng'anda, nayo Tomasi kakala hamwe nao. Lwivi ukala uhindigwa, mbali Yesu kengila, kema hagati yao kalonga,“Utindiwala ukale na mweye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Amala kamlongela Tomasi, “Chigale chidole chako hano na ulole makono gangu, golosa makono gako ugele mulubavu lwangu. Mbali seke uwe munhu yoleka kutogola, mbali uwe wa utogole!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi kalonga, “Mndewa wangu na Mulungu wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu kamlongela, “Ivo, kutogola kwa vija kuniona? Wokwing'higwa ganogile ga Mulungu waja wose hawanionile mbali watogola.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanduso cha kwandika chitabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu kasang'hana uzonza mwingi hawaluko wake, mbali hazandikgwe mchitabu chino. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Mbali mbuli zino zandikigwa ili mdahe kutogola kua Yesu iyo Kilisito Mwana wa Mulungu, na kwa kumtogola mdahe kua na ugima ulibule uhelelo kwakukala mgati yake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila waluko wake saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Vigamalile gago, Yesu kawalawila kaidi waluko wake hamgwazo ha lamba ya Tibelia. Nayo kawalawila vino, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo na Tomasi ija yokemigwa pacha, na ija Natanieli mwenekae wa Kana ya Galilaya, na wana waidi wa Zebedayo na waluko wamwenga waidi, wakala wose hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petulo kawalongela, “Noita kuloa somba.” Nao wamlongela, “Cheye choilongoza na gweye.” Baho waita na kukwela muingalawa, mbali chilo icho hawapatile chochose. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Lukwili imitondo, Yesu kema hamgwazo lamba, mbali waja waluko hawamanyile kama ija iyo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Baho Yesu kawauza, “Wabwanga hampatile somba wowose?” Wao wamwidika, “Hambe, hachinapata chinhu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu kawalongela, “Tandeni wavu ubanzi wa kulume mwa ngalawa na mweye mopata somba.” Baho, watanda nyavu zao ubanzi uo, mbali sambi hawadahile kukwega kaidi kwa wingi wa somba.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Baho ija mwaluko Yesu yeli na wende nayo kamlongela Petulo, “Che! Mndewa! Simoni Petulo viyahulike kua ni Mndewa, kaizinga valo jake, kwa vija kakala hanavala chivalo, nayo kazumha mmazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Mbali waja waluko wamwenga weza haingalawa, hawakalile hatali kulawa haingema yovika utali wa mita mia, wakwega lwavu umemile somba. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Viwavikile mhwani, wauona moto wa makala na hachanha yake hekigwa somba na mgate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu kawalongela, “Wagaleni hano somba chidogo muwatandile.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Basi, Simoni Petulo kakwela muingalawa na kuukwega uja lwavu mbaka muingema lwavu ukala umemile somba wakulu mia moja na hamsini na nhatu. Hata kama wakala wingi ivo wavu haudegeke. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu kawalongela, “Izoni mzimbuse tumbo.” Baho habule hata munhu imwe kulawa mja mwawaluko wake yagezile kumuuza, “Gweye kwa nani? Manake wavimanya kakala Mndewa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu kaita kausola mgate, kaweng'ha, na katenda na kwa waja somba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ino ikala mala ya kadatu Yesu kuwalawilila waluko wake kulawa viyazilibuke.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlagiza Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Viwakomeleze kuzimbusa tumbo, Yesu kamuuza Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana! Ivo, kuna wende na niye kubita wano?” Nayo kamwidika, Ena, Mndewa, kovimanya kua niye nina wende na gweye.” Yesu kamlongela, “Walise ng'hondolo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Amala Yesu kamulongela kaidi, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana! Ivo, kuna wende na niye?” Petulo kedika, “Ena Mndewa, gweye kuvimanya kua nina wende na gweye.” Yesu kamlongela, “Susila ng'hondolo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu kamuuza Petulo mala ya kadatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana! Ivo, kuna wende na niye?” Baho Petulo kagwa fufunhende ng'hani kwa vija Yesu kamuuza mala ya kadatu, “Kuna wende na niye?” Kamlongela, “Mndewa gweye kogamanya gose, gweye kovimanya kua nina wende na gweye.” Yesu kamalongela, “Walise ng'hondolo wangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kweli nokulongela, vuukalile mbwanga kuzoela kuifunga msipi na kuita kokose kuulonda. Mbali kuuvele kogolosa makono gako na munhu imwenga kokuvaza na kukugala kuja hulonda kuita.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Kwa kulonga ivo, Yesu kalagusa vija Petulo vondayadanganike na kumwing'ha nhogolwa Mulungu. Amala kamlongela, “Niwinze.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na ija mwaluko imwenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Baho Petulo kahinduka, kamuona ija mwaluko Yesu yeli na wende nayo, komuwinza yatogoligwe ng'hani na Yesu komuwinza, ino mwaluko iyo ija yamsigamile Yesu viwakalile muindia ya chigulogulo kumuuza, “Mndewa yelihi yonda yakuhinduke?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Basi Petulo kamuona iyo, kamuuza Yesu, “Mndewa chilihi chomlawila ino?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu kamlongela, “Kama nihalonda yasigale mbaka nibwele, “Gweye kuna mbuli yaki? Gweye niwinze niye.”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Baho mbuli iyo yenela mwa waja waluko kua mwaluko iyo hadanganika. Mbali Yesu hamlongele kua mwaluko iyo hadanganika ila kalonga, “Kama nolonda yasigale mbaka vonda nibwele, kuna mbuli yaki?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ino iyo ija yazionile mbuli zino na kuzandika. Na cheye chovimanya kua gayalongile ni kweli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za chikomelezo za Yohana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Hana mbuli zimwenga nyingi ziyasang'hane Yesu, maza zahandikigwe zose, imwe mbaka imwenga notonga kua hata isi yenyego yahelekile kwenela vitabu vija maza vyandikigwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>